translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_73d771c8:

    # "The snow-covered taiga stretches out as far as the eye could see, a serene yet harsh wilderness."
    "白雪覆盖的泰加林一望无际，呈现出一片宁静却严酷的荒野。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_1a96097c:

    # "Your breath mists in the cold air, and you can't help but shiver under your soft fur."
    "你的呼吸在寒冷的空气中化作白雾，柔软的毛皮下，你忍不住瑟瑟发抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_dad630b8:

    # "Tall pines stands sentinel, their branches are heavy with snow, and the ground is blanketed in a pristine, icy layer..."
    "高耸的松树如哨兵般伫立，枝头压着厚重的积雪，地面覆盖着一层洁净无瑕的冰雪……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_66807d48:

    # "You press on, the crunch of your boots on the snow is the only sound breaking the stillness."
    "你继续向前，靴子踩在积雪上的咯吱声成了打破寂静的唯一声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_374b9d71:

    # "As you venture deeper into the forest, a sudden rustling in the underbrush catches your attention."
    "你向森林深处继续前行时，灌木丛中突然传来一阵窸窣声，吸引了你的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_64b82135:

    # e "W-who's there?"
    e "谁、谁在那里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_938afc45:

    # "Your senses heighten as you scan the surroundings, your hand instinctively reaching for your weapon."
    "你的感官变得敏锐起来，扫视四周时，手也下意识地伸向武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_e42154ba:

    # "From between the trees, someone stumbles into your view. His breath came in ragged gasps, and his clothing ripped."
    "树丛间，一个人踉踉跄跄地闯入你的视野。他喘得断断续续，衣服也被撕破了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_1ddf8d22:

    # "It was an elk, the white fur shawl draped over his shoulders, his arctic blue pupils glisten as your eyes meet."
    "那是一头麋鹿，白色毛皮披肩搭在肩头；与你四目相对时，他北极般湛蓝的瞳孔闪烁着光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_e4014fa9:

    # "His gaze is locked with yours, desperation in his eyes."
    "他的目光紧锁着你，眼中满是绝望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_12bd9e8d:

    # "Moments later, a group of armed guards burst into the clearing, their tribal markings distinct on their armor."
    "片刻后，一队武装守卫冲进空地，他们铠甲上的部族纹样清晰可辨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_a772780e:

    # "His cheeks turn white, just like his fur. Fear etched across his face as he glances back over his shoulder."
    "他的脸颊变得和皮毛一样苍白，回头瞥去时，恐惧刻在了他的脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_be03604c:

    # "For a few seconds, you wait for the man to speak, but instead he remains silent."
    "你等了几秒，等那人开口，可他却始终沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_ffef5500:

    # e "C-can I help you?"
    e "我、我能帮你吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_f0b80f4c:

    # "He doesn't respond, but instead hold your hand in between his cold palms. His eyes are pleading, but you do not know how to help him."
    "他没有回答，只是将你的手握在冰冷的双掌之间。他的眼神充满哀求，可你不知道该如何帮助他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_62364d04:

    # "You hesitate, nodding nervously, torn between the instinct to help and the wariness of getting involved in a situation you didn't fully understand."
    "你犹豫着紧张地点了点头，在想要伸手相助的本能与不愿卷入这场自己尚未完全理解的事态的戒心之间挣扎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_3849f614:

    # "The stranger nudges at your hand before releasing it, and he turns and bolts down the small hill behind you."
    "陌生人在松开你的手前轻轻碰了碰，随后转身沿你身后的小坡冲了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_32f5b689:

    # bearGuard2 "He can't be far, where did that damn deer go?"
    bearGuard2 "他不可能跑远，那该死的麋鹿跑哪儿去了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_5cb533f4:

    # bearGuard "You there, did you see the man with a hood there?"
    bearGuard "你，那边的，你看到那个戴兜帽的男人了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_506c4c79:

    # "The guards quickly catches up and turns to you, their expressions demanding answers."
    "守卫很快追了上来，转身面向你，神情逼着你给出答案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_7172bcb9:

    # "It's only when they get closer, that you can peek under their helmet, along with their clothing lined with thick fur."
    "直到他们靠近，你才看清他们头盔下的模样，以及衣物里衬着的厚厚皮毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_2d8e96d4:

    # "The bear guards are out of breath and disoriented, their breath forming clouds in the frigid air."
    "熊族守卫们气喘吁吁，神情茫然，呼出的气息在冰冷的空气中凝成一团团白雾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_b78a89ca:

    # e "W-who are you? And who is the man you're looking for?"
    e "你、你们是谁？你们要找的那个男人又是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_9aab3891:

    # "His eyes narrowing as he sizes you up, while the other guard looks all around for the fugitive."
    "他眯起眼睛打量着你，另一名守卫则四处寻找逃犯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_3e35b1aa:

    # bearGuard2 "Stay out of this, stranger! This is none of your concern."
    bearGuard2 "别插手，陌生人！这不关你的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_9bcaf225:

    # "You stare at the guard's hand, he is holding a long harpoon, one that would have been lethal..."
    "你盯着守卫手中的东西，发现那是一柄长鱼叉，足以致命……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_d195e911:

    # bearGuard "Quit wasting our time, where is the man? I know he ran this way." nointeract
    bearGuard "别再浪费我们的时间了，那个人在哪儿？我知道他往这边跑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_e7aa49e5:

    # e "I saw him heading there."
    e "我看见他往那边去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c6f72e15:

    # "You point towards the wrong direction, fully understanding that you're leading them to a false trail."
    "你指向错误的方向，心知肚明自己是在把他们引向一条假线索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_89d68c97:

    # bearGuard "Good."
    bearGuard "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b43d5edd:

    # "They head off towards the direction you pointed, their footsteps crunching through the snow as they tread deep into the taiga forest."
    "他们朝你所指的方向离去，脚步踩在积雪上嘎吱作响，逐渐深入泰加林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_f76534aa:

    # "In the distance, the hooded man takes advantage of the diversion and continues his frantic escape, you watch as he nods to you, and runs away behind the guard's back."
    "远处，戴兜帽的男人利用这次调虎离山，继续慌不择路地逃跑。你看着他朝你点了点头，然后从守卫身后跑开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_a7d25fae:

    # "Soon, he disappears among the tall pines and snowdrifts, leaving no trace of his whereabouts."
    "很快，他消失在高耸的松树和积雪堆间，不留半点踪迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_1ce5191a:

    # "Once more, you stand alone in the quiet taiga, the snow-covered landscape enveloping you in solitude."
    "你再次独自站在寂静的泰加林中，白雪覆盖的景色将你笼罩在孤寂之中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b4f781f7:

    # "You shake your head, perhaps it's an everyday occurence to the unforgiving snow around here, but just as the guard says, you might as well stay out of this matter."
    "你摇了摇头。或许对这里无情的风雪而言，这不过是家常便饭；但正如那名守卫所说，你还是别插手这件事为好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_429bb72c:

    # "Suddenly, the quiet is broken by the sound of approaching footsteps."
    "突然，寂静被逐渐逼近的脚步声打破。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b97b807f:

    # "When you turn back, you're greeted by another guard, his armor adorned with intricate tribal markings, this time without a makeshift helmet."
    "你转身时，迎面走来另一名守卫。他的铠甲上饰有繁复的部落纹样，这次头上没有临时凑合的头盔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_cac5ea13:

    # "His fur is white, a youthful expression across his face as he arrives alone."
    "他有着一身白色皮毛，脸上带着年轻人的神情，独自走了过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3c2ef644:

    # bearCommander "E-excuse me, Sir, please stay, at least until we're finished."
    bearCommander "呃、先生，请留步，至少等我们处理完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d3ada9c3:

    # "You wait for another question from the guards, instead the only thing you hear is the clear yet deep note as he raises the horn to his lips and blows softly."
    "你等着守卫再问些什么，可听到的却只有一声清亮而低沉的号音——他将号角举到唇边，轻轻吹响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_42e8c608:

    # "You can feel the whole forest vibrating, resonating through the whole snow-covered ground. The call to action has probably alerted the rest of the guards as you see them quickly abandoning the chase."
    "你能感受到整片森林都在震颤，回声透过覆雪的大地传遍四方。这个行动号令大概已经惊动了其余守卫，你看着他们迅速放弃追捕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c01536b9:

    # "Another loud horn reverberates, at the same time the guards have made their way towards the white bear guard."
    "又一声响亮的号角回荡开来，与此同时，守卫们已朝那名白熊守卫赶来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_ea6566ed:

    # "Soon, you're surrounded by the same guards chasing after the hooded man mere minute ago."
    "很快，你就被刚才还在追赶兜帽男人的同一批守卫包围了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_4b02ae7a:

    # bearGuard "You! You knowingly led us astray! We could have caught him right there."
    bearGuard "你！你明知故犯地把我们引向了歧途！我们本来当场就能抓住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d9c32f51:

    # "One of the bears approaches you with a stern expression, pointing his harpoon at you with his accusation."
    "一名熊人神情严厉地朝你走来，指责你的同时将鱼叉指向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c19b1672:

    # bearCommander "Calm down-"
    bearCommander "冷静——"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_5db00fd7:

    # bearGuard2 "How! Did Herd conspire with you together?"
    bearGuard2 "什么！赫德难道和你串通好了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_ad3d1a81:

    # "You raise both your hands defensively, they hang heavy in the frigid air, your heart is pounding so quickly as the tip of the harpoon is mere inches apart from your chest."
    "你防备地举起双手，双臂在凛冽的空气中沉沉垂着；你的心脏狂跳不止，鱼叉尖端离你的胸口仅有几英寸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_e68ec5b6:

    # "The rest of the guard falls silent, even the white bear is waiting anxiously for your response."
    "其余守卫都沉默下来，就连那头白熊也在焦急地等待你的回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d58d2031:

    # e "I-I did, he looked scared of you guys, and I don't even know anyone here."
    e "我、我确实和他串通了。他看起来很怕你们，而且我根本不认识这里的任何人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3325b28d:

    # bearGuard "W-what? Can you even fathom the consequences of your actions? Do you even know who you're talking to?"
    bearGuard "什、什么？你到底知不知道自己这么做的后果？你知道自己在和谁说话吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_afc4c7cd:

    # "You cannot fathom, probably because you have probably not ever heard about that name before, but, it's merely a thought you don't dare to speak out loud."
    "你想不明白，大概是因为你以前从未听说过那个名字；但这也只是个你不敢说出口的念头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_86e68085:

    # "The guards' faces are darkened with anger, you can feel the tip of the harpoon pokes into the fur on your chest, in the brink of puncturing your thin skin."
    "守卫们的脸庞因愤怒而阴沉，你能感觉到鱼叉尖端抵住了胸口的皮毛，几乎就要刺穿你薄薄的皮肤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_1eb363a3:

    # bearGuard2 "Commander, we should capture him. Chief Kaurhu needs to know what happened here."
    bearGuard2 "指挥官，我们应该把他抓起来。卡乌胡酋长必须知道这里发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_dfa0ca92:

    # "The commander nods and steps forward, his demeanor remaining composed, much different from the other guards' fury."
    "指挥官点了点头，迈步向前，神态依旧镇定，与其他守卫的怒火截然不同。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_917bb259:

    # bearCommander "Needless to say, stranger. Your actions have hindered our mission."
    bearCommander "不用说，陌生人。你的行为已经妨碍了我们的任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_589d8308:

    # "He turns to you, his tone is stern and soothing, you wouldn't ever imagine that voice coming from a bear, but honestly, you've never seen a bear up close before, to your knowledge."
    "他转身面向你，语气严厉却又平和。你怎么也想不到，这样的声音竟会出自一头熊之口。不过说实话，据你所知，你以前从未近距离见过熊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_2bbc6a2a:

    # bearCommander "But I don't see why you would admit anything if you're truly guilty."
    bearCommander "但如果你真的有罪，我实在想不通你为什么要承认。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_ff4802f8:

    # e "Yes, I really have no idea he's a bad person, I just got here and I don't know anything..."
    e "是的，我真的不知道他是个坏人。我才刚到这里，什么都不了解……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_14bf1634:

    # bearCommander "Where are you heading?"
    bearCommander "你要去哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_79831fc5:

    # e "I'm not sure, I was just traveling around."
    e "我不确定，我只是四处旅行而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_f53b9604:

    # bearCommander "An adventurer...? Well, we appreciate your intention, you should continue o-"
    bearCommander "冒险者……？嗯，我们很欣赏你的意愿，你应该继续前——"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d85541b6:

    # bearGuard "Commander, don't you think, Chief would like to see this man and make his own judgement?"
    bearGuard "指挥官，你不觉得酋长会想见见这个人，亲自作出判断吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c8bc3a91:

    # "An old guard from behind cuts off the white bear, the guards exchange glances, nodding all at the same time."
    "后方一名年长的守卫打断了白熊的话，守卫们彼此交换眼神，同时点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_5720ea58:

    # "His expression comes off as a shocked face, but not very surprised. If it was your elder back in your land he'd never once let the follower disrespect him like that."
    "他的表情看起来很震惊，却并没有多么意外。如果换作你故乡的长者，他绝不会容许追随者那样对他无礼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_29ff317d:

    # e "No! I didn't know where he's headed. I must have mistaken that, but I didn't know."
    e "不！我不知道他要去哪里。我一定是弄错了，但我真的不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_61f8b7d3:

    # bearGuard "You think you're fooling us? You think you can just lie to our faces and get away with it?"
    bearGuard "你以为能骗过我们？你以为就这么当着我们的面撒谎，还能全身而退？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_65971ac3:

    # "The first guard's face reddens with anger, and his fists clench at your response and you can feel the harpoon begins to pierce through your skin."
    "第一名守卫因你的回答而满脸涨红，双拳紧握；你能感觉到鱼叉开始刺入你的皮肤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_0b9bac99:

    # "The rest of the guards, equally infuriated, close in around you. They exchange heated whispers and stern glances, clearly debating their course of action."
    "其余守卫同样怒不可遏，向你围拢过来。他们低声激烈交谈，投来严厉的目光，显然正在争论该如何处置你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_95e80b4d:

    # "You're not sure what happened to lead you to this point, how come this brief encounter has turned into something that could've taken your life right here."
    "你不知道究竟发生了什么，才会让事态发展到这一步；这场短暂的相遇，怎么会变成一场险些让你当场丧命的灾难？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_4fbd910c:

    # bearCommander "What's the odd that he's truly innocent, would you all rather attribute wrongdoings to malice than pure ignorance?"
    bearCommander "他真的清白的可能性有多大？你们宁愿把他的过错归咎于恶意，也不愿相信那只是无知吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_5b479586:

    # bearGuard "Commander, we can all tell he's lying, he must be with Herd."
    bearGuard "指挥官，我们都看得出来他在撒谎，他一定是赫德的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d66d3371:

    # bearCommander "What can Herd offer him, a stranger, that he would risk his life for?"
    bearCommander "赫德能给这个陌生人什么，值得他拿性命去冒险？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_24950ce1:

    # bearCommander "Even if he's lying, it could've been because he's scared of you all, isn't that right?"
    bearCommander "就算他在撒谎，也可能只是因为害怕你们所有人，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_64005138:

    # "He turns to you with a faint smile, you're not sure why he would do that as a commander of the tribe you've never met, but at least the guard's animosity has simmered down."
    "他转过身，朝你露出淡淡的微笑。你不明白，作为一个你从未见过的部族的指挥官，他为什么要这么做，但至少守卫的敌意已经平息了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_9c9dfb55:

    # bearGuard "Well, commander, don't you think, if we're not sure which is which. Then maybe it's best we let chief decide instead?"
    bearGuard "不过，指挥官，既然我们无法确定真相，你不觉得还是让酋长来决定比较好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c197e3e0:

    # bearGuard2 "Chief should be informed about him at least, we should lock him up before Chief gives any judgement."
    bearGuard2 "至少应该把他的事禀报酋长。在酋长作出判断前，我们应该先把他关起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_55f8861f:

    # "The white bear nods, his expression is calm, but you can see hesitation in his eyes."
    "白熊点了点头，神情平静，但你能看出他眼中带着犹豫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d2ca96a0:

    # bearCommander "I-I understand, well. Stranger, would you like to come with us for a brief discussion, as a witness?"
    bearCommander "我——我明白了。那个，陌生人，你愿意和我们一起去谈谈吗？你可以作为证人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_f1d595d2:

    # e "U-uh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_1483d5b2:

    # "Before the commander finishes his sentence, the guards have already working on cuffing your hands, and honestly, you're starting to think they intent to convict you on the spot if not for the commander."
    "指挥官的话还没说完，卫兵们已经开始给你铐上手铐了。老实说，要不是指挥官在场，你觉得他们恐怕当场就要给你定罪了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_e75923c7:

    # bearCommander "Please uncuff our guest, we wouldn't want him to get hurt before Kaurhu's judgement."
    bearCommander "请给我们的客人解开手铐，在考尔胡作出裁决前，我们可不想让他受伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_bd813fc4:

    # "You notice the guards have grown much more impatient, but they comply quickly."
    "你注意到卫兵们变得更加不耐烦了，但他们还是很快照做了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_35fa37cd:

    # bearGuard "Follow us closely, stranger. If I see you wander off anywhere, I won't hesitate to pierce you with my harpoon."
    bearGuard "跟紧我们，陌生人。要是让我看见你擅自离开，我会毫不犹豫地用鱼叉刺穿你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_22836183:

    # "You're not sure if he's being suggestive or literal, probably latter. But there's no way you can escape from this situation anyway."
    "你不确定他是在说荤话，还是在说字面意思，但后者的可能性更大。不过，无论如何，你都不可能从这种处境中逃脱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_03523d96:

    # "The guards lead you through the snow-covered wilderness, as the supposedly commander follows from behind you."
    "卫兵们带着你穿过白雪覆盖的荒野，而那位所谓的指挥官则跟在你身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3d67de1a:

    # bearCommander "Traveller, what's your name?"
    bearCommander "旅行者，你叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_5031b55a:

    # e "[e]."
    e "[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_1e22f690:

    # "He taps your shoulder, signaling for you to walk beside him, which attracts some glances from the guards in the front."
    "他拍了拍你的肩膀，示意你走到他身边，这一举动引来了前方几名卫兵的侧目。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d6624356:

    # d "My name's Daggi, the commander of the bear tribe."
    d "我叫达吉，是熊族的指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c62c8f11:

    # d "The elk man you just saw, Herd, we tried to track him down, but he kept running away from us. We are afraid he might be planning something against our tribe."
    d "你刚才见到的那个麋鹿人赫德，我们曾试图追踪他，可他一直从我们手中逃走。我们担心他可能在策划对付我们部族的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c0e98d26:

    # e "Why are you telling me this now?"
    e "你现在为什么要告诉我这些？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_138bfcfa:

    # d "I don't believe you're involved with Herd personally, therefore, I want you to prepare when you meet our chief, [e]."
    d "我不认为你和赫德本人有什么牵连，所以我希望你在见到我们的酋长时做好准备，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b5d95df5:

    # "You nod respectfully, and Commander Daggi nods back, he slowly walks up to the front as you follow the guards."
    "你恭敬地点了点头，达吉指挥官也点头回应。他慢慢走到队伍前方，而你则跟着卫兵们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3156cef1:

    # "After some time, the thick taiga giving way to a well-trodden path that winds its way down into a snow-filled valley."
    "过了一段时间，茂密的泰加林渐渐让出一条人迹常走的小路，蜿蜒着向下通入一片积雪覆盖的山谷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_604182cc:

    # "The tall pine trees gradually thin out, replaced by the sprawling landscape of the village around, and below."
    "高耸的松树逐渐变得稀疏，取而代之的是周围以及下方一览无余的村庄景色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_418fda52:

    # "Already you hear loud clanking sounds, some wooden wheels are spinning by themselves, with carts full of goods sprawling around the village."
    "你已经听见响亮的铿锵声了；一些木轮自行转动着，装满货物的车子散布在村庄各处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_2ea15c13:

    # "You walk up, and talk to one of the guards."
    "你走上前，和一名卫兵交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_060dbb33:

    # e "Hey, is this the bear tribe?"
    e "喂，这里就是熊族吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_dbda6625:

    # "You'd expect a nod at least, but he doesn't respond, not even giving you a worthy glance. So you quickly returns to the back, and let the guards lead you away."
    "你本以为至少能得到一个点头，可他没有回应，甚至懒得正眼看你一眼。于是你赶紧回到队伍后方，任由卫兵们带着你离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_9c216a74:

    # "With a begrudging wave from the commander, the guards escort you back toward their village, their frosty silence punctuated only by the loudness of the village itself."
    "指挥官不情不愿地挥了挥手，卫兵们护送你返回他们的村庄；他们冰冷的沉默中，只有村庄本身的喧闹声不时响起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_96052180:

    # "The roof of their houses are covered in thick snow, and you're soon led up a flight of snowy stairs, leading to a bridge that stands over a deep icy chasm."
    "他们的房屋屋顶覆盖着厚厚的积雪，很快，你便被带上一段覆雪的阶梯，通往一座横跨幽深冰峡的桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_54e5e2f3:

    # "The Chief's Hall awaits on the other side of the bridge, a formidable structure just like the others, albeit much more grandiose."
    "酋长大厅就在桥的另一头，那是一座和其他建筑一样坚固的庞然大物，只是气势更为恢宏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_2e70bce7:

    # "Daggi gestures for you to follow him, and you walk across the bridge, the icy wind biting at your fur."
    "达吉示意你跟上他。你们走过桥，刺骨的寒风刮过你的皮毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_0b59a5b9:

    # "Inside the council, you hear a few coughing sound from within the settlement. A chair surrounded by advisors and elders, chattering amongst themselves."
    "在议事厅内，你听见聚落中传来几声咳嗽。一把椅子四周围着顾问和长老，他们彼此喋喋不休。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_8b19c9f5:

    # "As you enter, the room suddenly falls silent, the weight of their collective gaze falls upon you and the guards."
    "你一走进去，房间里突然鸦雀无声，所有人的目光沉沉地落在你和卫兵身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_233b5d36:

    # d "Chief! Are you alright?"
    d "酋长！您没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c435d1aa:

    # "A voice calls for the chief as you see the commander runs up in front of the throne."
    "一个声音呼唤着酋长，你看见那名指挥官跑到王座前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d65cc3c3:

    # "On the throne sits an old brown bear, one whose wrinkles etch deep into his weathered face. He coughs once more, drawing the attention of the young commander."
    "王座上坐着一头年迈的棕熊，他饱经风霜的脸上刻满了深深的皱纹。他又咳了一声，吸引了年轻指挥官的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_4eec777d:

    # "His beard, a cascade of icy white, messily hangs around the brownish stubbles."
    "他那瀑布般的冰白胡须凌乱地垂在棕色的胡茬周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_75507288:

    # bearChief "I'm fine, you little snowball."
    bearChief "我没事，小雪球。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b8236f47:

    # "The brown bear clears his throat, then glances at the guards in front of you briefly."
    "棕熊清了清嗓子，然后短暂地瞥了一眼你面前的卫兵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_35e470cc:

    # bearChief "What's the matter? Where's that sack of shit, shouldn't he be rotting in my prison ten minutes ago?"
    bearChief "怎么回事？那坨狗屎在哪儿？十分钟前他不就该在我的牢里烂着了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_aee11ff2:

    # bearGuard "C-chief Kaurhu, we couldn't catch him yet, but we found one of his accomplices."
    bearGuard "首、酋长卡乌胡，我们还没抓到他，但找到了他的一个同伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_0f137984:

    # "Your eyes widen as the bear guard beside you points his finger, both bears on the throne furrow their brows on this accusation."
    "你身旁的熊卫兵伸手指向你，你顿时瞪大了眼睛；王座旁的两头熊都因这番指控而皱起眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_8a8f3080:

    # e "I-I don't know anything about Herd! This is my first time being here."
    e "我、我什么都不知道！我这是第一次来这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d83fe2e8:

    # bearGuard "We caught him trying to distract us from catching Herd, he helped him to escape."
    bearGuard "我们抓到他时，他正想分散我们抓捕赫德的注意力，是他帮赫德逃走的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_a081d382:

    # "The elders around the chief look at one another, then they scatter and walk away, revealing the old chief slumped against the throne, raising his brows."
    "酋长身旁的长老们互相对望，随后纷纷散开离去，露出那个靠在王座上、扬起眉毛的老酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_aeda43cc:

    # kh "Explain yourself."
    kh "解释清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3b269090:

    # e "Uh, I have never been here, or seen you guys. I was walking by and I saw the guards chasing after someone."
    e "呃，我从没来过这里，也没见过你们。我只是路过，看见卫兵在追赶某个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b5cb78f1:

    # "The chief listens intently, his gaze almost unrelenting as he absorbs your words."
    "酋长专注地听着，吸收你的话语时，目光几乎片刻不移。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_6a2ce497:

    # e "I wanted to save that poor guy, so I... might have led the guards somewhere else so that man can escape."
    e "我想救那个可怜的家伙，所以我……可能把卫兵引到了别处，好让那个人逃走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_5e8ddf26:

    # e "But I don't know anything!"
    e "但我什么都不知道！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c1e591fe:

    # e "I didn't see him too clearly, so when they asked me I might have pointed to the wrong direction."
    e "我没看太清楚，所以他们问我的时候，我可能指错了方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_4e3d063c:

    # d "We still don't know what Herd was doing yesterday. We need to find him first!"
    d "我们还是不知道赫德昨天在做什么。我们得先找到他！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_75b7be9f:

    # "The commander exclaims, his words assured."
    "指挥官语气笃定地喊道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_7df1300f:

    # bearGuard "Then we should lock this strange face down there right now, so the rest of us can focus on trailing him."
    bearGuard "那我们现在就该把这张陌生面孔关到下面去，这样我们其他人就能专心追踪他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_61e7817c:

    # d "No, he's not involved, and we need to find out what happened yesterday first. We can't just lock him up without any evidence."
    d "不，他没有牵涉其中，我们得先查清楚昨天发生了什么。没有任何证据，不能就这么把他关起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_f9263b8d:

    # bearGuard "He's a stranger, and he's lying to us. We can't just let him go like that, we need to lock him up right now-"
    bearGuard "他是个陌生人，还在对我们撒谎。不能就这样放他走，得马上把他关起来——"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_38b03904:

    # kh "Enough!"
    kh "够了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_37a373b8:

    # "The chief bellows, his patience has worn thin, slamming his hand down on the side of the throne."
    "酋长怒吼一声，忍耐已然耗尽，同时一掌拍在王座侧面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_d55c230e:

    # kh "Instead of arguing non-stop in front of my throne, how about focus on the task at hand, I need that sack of shit caught right now."
    kh "别在我的王座前没完没了地争吵了，还是专心处理眼下的事吧。我现在就要抓住那坨狗屎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b75dcfdd:

    # "He glances around the hall, and addresses the guards, and everyone else, it's clear he's trying to keep his composure over his wrath."
    "他环视大厅，向守卫和其他人发话，显然正努力压住自己的怒火，保持镇定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_ca834708:

    # kh "And before we find out what he intended yesterday, don't you ever try to spread meaningless rumors around my tribe."
    kh "在查清他昨天的意图之前，谁都不许再在我的部落里散播毫无意义的流言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_13caaecb:

    # kh "Or I will have your head on the plate before you all ever know it, understand?"
    kh "不然，等你们反应过来时，我就会把你的脑袋摆上盘子，明白了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_2458825a:

    # "The room becomes silent once more."
    "房间里再次陷入寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_f26f875e:

    # kh "You are dismissed."
    kh "你们可以退下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_78a38220:

    # "The guards nod, they bedgrudgingly exchange reluctant glances before turning back and leave the room."
    "守卫们点头，心不甘情不愿地交换了几个眼神，随后转身离开了房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_db4b3409:

    # d "Thank you, chief."
    d "谢谢您，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_4ffabde8:

    # kh "Commander Daggi, the guards, they're yours now. I expect a better discipline and unity among your men. Use what you were taught."
    kh "达吉指挥官，守卫们现在归你管了。我希望你手下的人能有更好的纪律性和团结精神。把你受过的教导用起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c9a4bb3e:

    # kh "Don't make me worry about you again."
    kh "别再让我为你担心了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_e1ec5dd5:

    # "The chief coughs loudly, before turning to you with a rougher voice."
    "酋长重重咳嗽一声，随后转向你，语气也变得更加粗厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_8a42e3c1:

    # kh "You, what's your name?"
    kh "你，说说你的名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_b81630a4:

    # e "My name is [e], chief. I'm a courier from Lusterfield."
    e "我叫[e]，酋长。我是从卢斯特菲尔德来的信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_c7497259:

    # kh "Oh, a courier, got any letters for me?"
    kh "哦，信使？有我的信吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_7b720758:

    # e "N-no... I was just travelling by."
    e "不、不是……我只是路过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3afd34dd:

    # "Kaurhu shakes his head."
    "卡乌胡摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_5271a0ec:

    # kh "[e], go about your own business back south. We have enough troubles to deal with, I don't need another fly buzzing around my ears."
    kh "[e]，回南边办你自己的事去。我们已经有够多麻烦要处理了，不需要再有一只苍蝇在我耳边嗡嗡叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_3bf3f47f:

    # kh "And I'll be honest, don't ever talk to our folks about what happened today. Or I will send you to the prison myself."
    kh "我就直说了，今天发生的事，你绝不许向我们的族人提起。否则，我会亲自把你送进监狱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_bdfe0c46:

    # kh "Am I clear?"
    kh "我说得够清楚了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_ebb3934e:

    # kh "Commander, escort [e] out of our tribe, quietly. We won't be accepting any more visitors."
    kh "指挥官，悄悄把[e]送出我们的部落。我们不再接待任何访客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_68b42240:

    # d "Yes, chief."
    d "是的，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_315eafbb:

    # "Commander Daggi stands behind you, and gestures to lead you the way."
    "达吉指挥官站在你身后，示意你跟上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Mislead_eea9ee39:

    # d "This way, [e]."
    d "这边，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b9ac8776:

    # "You point toward the small hill behind you, fully understanding that you're aiding the guards in their pursuit."
    "你指向身后那座小山，完全明白自己正在帮助卫兵追捕他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f69e4267:

    # e "He... he went down there."
    e "他……他往那边下去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_cddf67e7:

    # "The first guard nods approvingly, his intimidating demeanor softening just slightly."
    "第一名卫兵赞许地点了点头，吓人的神态稍稍缓和了几分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_89d68c97:

    # bearGuard "Good."
    bearGuard "很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f470ecb1:

    # "He grumbles, and the guards follow your indicated path, moving down by each step."
    "他低声咕哝着，卫兵们沿着你指的路，一步步往下走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7261763c:

    # bearGuard "Right there..."
    bearGuard "就在那儿……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_4454884b:

    # "You watch them descend a small hill, their footsteps muffled by the thick snow, but they are careless with the way they talk, supposedly that much noise is going to startle whoever hiding around here."
    "你看着他们走下小山，厚厚的积雪掩去了脚步声，可他们说话时毫不在意动静，想必这么大的声音会惊动藏在附近的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_31149557:

    # bearGuard "I see h-"
    bearGuard "我看见了——"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_c820e960:

    # "In an instant, the hooded man jolts away from behind a tree, the guards instantly shout, calling out for him."
    "戴兜帽的男人突然从树后窜出，卫兵们立刻大喊着叫住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5fa64d46:

    # bearGuard "Hey! Stop right there!"
    bearGuard "喂！站住！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_bdb4f9ed:

    # bearGuard2 "Herd, you can't run away forever."
    bearGuard2 "赫德，你不可能永远逃下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f9f48b2b:

    # "Seeing that the man is about to escape, the guards grips onto his weapon tightly, closing one eye as he aims for the man."
    "眼看那人就要逃走，卫兵们紧紧握住武器，闭上一只眼瞄准他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_c8b7d39e:

    # e "No!"
    e "不！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_febd8989:

    # "Just as it seems he is disappearing from your sight, a harpoon zooms through the frigid air, piercing through the escapee's shoulder."
    "就在那人仿佛要从你的视线中消失之际，一支鱼叉划过凛冽的空气，刺穿了逃亡者的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_e3799ab6:

    # "You hear a loud yelp as the man cries in pain, but he continues on staggering, leaving behind a blood trail on the white snow."
    "你听见男人痛苦地发出一声惨叫，可他仍踉跄着继续前进，在白雪上留下一道血迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d455e151:

    # e "Oh no..."
    e "哦，不……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d5e874bf:

    # "The guards quickly give chase, their heavy boots crunching through the snow."
    "卫兵们迅速追了上去，沉重的靴子踩在积雪上，发出嘎吱声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_0de17a6c:

    # "Despite the injury, the man manages to put some distance between himself and the guards, heavy breaths echoes as the guards keep on chasing."
    "尽管受了伤，那人还是设法拉开了与卫兵之间的距离。卫兵们继续追赶，沉重的喘息声回荡在空中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d0fd85dc:

    # "You cautiously follow the guards, there is no way you can leave this place without knowing what happened to the man."
    "你小心翼翼地跟在卫兵们身后。不弄清楚那人究竟发生了什么，你就绝不可能离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5735354a:

    # bearGuard2 "S-shit."
    bearGuard2 "妈——的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_975fc557:

    # "You notice the blood trail seem to be much thicker by the time, it's not a good sign..."
    "你注意到血迹一路变得浓重了许多，这可不是什么好兆头……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_95f67cea:

    # "A long horn can be heard from a distance before you finally catches up to the two guards."
    "远处传来一声悠长的号角，之后你终于追上了两名卫兵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_4635efd8:

    # "After the chase, the two bears in front of you finally stops, but you sense something, eerie about them."
    "追逐过后，你前方的两头熊终于停了下来，但你察觉到它们身上有种诡异的感觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_74c1099d:

    # "You stare at their backs, head droops down, seemingly focused on something ahead."
    "你盯着它们的背影，只见它们低垂着脑袋，似乎正专注于前方某处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a9e9d1ce:

    # "The shouts turn into complete silence, it is almost jarring, knowing that they just sent a harpoon flying a few minutes ago."
    "呼喊声变成一片死寂。想到几分钟前它们才刚把鱼叉掷出去，这场寂静着实令人毛骨悚然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_890653d7:

    # "Out of curiosity, you approach, as you peek from behind the bear..."
    "出于好奇，你走近一些，从熊身后探头望去……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_106cc465:

    # "Lied on the snow, the man you just saw, is now soaked in a pood of blood."
    "那个你刚才见过的男人正躺在雪地上，如今已浸在一大片血泊中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_216b0d45:

    # "The harpoon seem to puncture deep from behind his back, it could almost come out from the other side."
    "鱼叉似乎从他背后深深刺入，几乎要从另一侧穿出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d0cfe77c:

    # "His eyes are barely opened, but they never close again. The lack of breath tells you that he is already gone."
    "他的双眼仅仅睁着一条缝，却再也不会闭上了。没有呼吸，这说明他已经死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b7693681:

    # e "Is he dead?"
    e "他死了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5e155d06:

    # bearGuard "We just arrived..."
    bearGuard "我们才刚赶到……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_363bca36:

    # bearGuard "Shit, I told you to take it steady, the architect is not built for this!"
    bearGuard "该死，我就叫你稳着点，建筑师可经不起这种事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d1e812d3:

    # bearGuard2 "I- I didn't mean to, I aimed at his arms, we had to stop him no matter what."
    bearGuard2 "我——我不是故意的，我瞄准的是他的手臂；无论如何我们都得阻止他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_0e2258f5:

    # bearGuard2 "How could I know that's going to kill him... he seemed fine."
    bearGuard2 "我怎么会知道那会要了他的命……他看起来明明没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d8b1bd68:

    # e "D-did I just kill him...?"
    e "我——我刚才杀了他……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_15ee5ea3:

    # "You stutter in pure sorrow, you can't even comprehend being the cause of someone's death, because you told the truth."
    "你悲恸万分地结结巴巴，甚至无法理解自己竟会成为害死某人的原因，因为你说了实话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_60f9b12c:

    # "Afterall, you were just wandering about, how could you expect that five minutes later, someone is killed in front of your eyes?"
    "毕竟你刚才还只是在四处游荡，怎么会想到五分钟后就有人在你眼前被杀？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7750c855:

    # "You kneel on the ground, trying to get a sense of his heartbeat, even as the blood begins to soak through your fur."
    "你跪在地上，试图感受他的心跳，即使血液开始浸透你的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a191ddf2:

    # "The bear guards stare at you, they exchange glances before lending a hand."
    "熊卫兵盯着你，彼此交换了一个眼神，才伸手相助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_8d30dc37:

    # bearGuard "You won't be blamed for any of this, traveller."
    bearGuard "这件事不会怪到你头上，旅行者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7414be93:

    # "He takes a deep breath."
    "他深深吸了一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_de03e0c1:

    # bearGuard "He is already gone."
    bearGuard "他已经死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_cf8e90d2:

    # bearGuard2 "How do we tell chief?"
    bearGuard2 "我们要怎么告诉酋长？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b6b21f95:

    # bearCommander "W-what's going on? Whose blood was that-"
    bearCommander "发——发生什么事了？那是谁的血——"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b97b807f:

    # "When you turn back, you're greeted by another guard, his armor adorned with intricate tribal markings, this time without a makeshift helmet."
    "当你回头时，迎面而来的是另一名卫兵。他的铠甲饰有复杂的部落纹样，这次头上没有临时拼凑的头盔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_cac5ea13:

    # "His fur is white, a youthful expression across his face as he arrives alone."
    "他独自赶来，身上的毛发雪白，脸上带着一副稚气的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_2cb88725:

    # bearCommander "H-Herd!"
    bearCommander "赫——赫德！"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5033eb48:

    # "He gasps, his eyes widens as he notices the limp body floating on the pool of blood."
    "他倒吸一口气，注意到那具无力的身体漂浮在血泊中，双眼倏然瞪大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_4c0081b5:

    # "The two guards turn their head in unison, their expressions are grim, but they remain silent."
    "两名守卫齐齐转过头，神情凝重，却保持沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_629eac0b:

    # bearCommander "W-what happened? How did he die?"
    bearCommander "发、发生了什么？他是怎么死的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_56b4ef1f:

    # bearGuard2 "We were chasing him, he was running away, so I tried to stop him."
    bearGuard2 "我们当时在追他，他一直在逃，所以我想拦住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_1c5db9c7:

    # bearGuard2 "I did not know that could kill him, I swear."
    bearGuard2 "我不知道那样会杀死他，我发誓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a0db3e45:

    # bearCommander "No, no, no, no..."
    bearCommander "不，不，不，不……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_95d9c832:

    # "The commander paces around, his eyes are wide, his hands are shaking as he tries to comprehend the situation."
    "指挥官来回踱步，双眼圆睁，双手颤抖着，试图弄清眼前的状况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_1e8cb8d5:

    # bearCommander "How could this happen? He wasn't supposed to die..."
    bearCommander "怎么会这样？他不该死的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_3b3988bb:

    # bearGuard "Keep calm, we will report to Chief directly."
    bearGuard "冷静点，我们直接去向酋长报告。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7a4169ab:

    # "The white bear glances at you for a few times before noticing you."
    "白熊无意间朝你瞥了好几眼，随后才注意到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_28be6fd0:

    # "He composes himself quickly from the shock, and turns to you with a stern expression."
    "他很快从震惊中镇定下来，转身面向你，神情严肃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7eecd151:

    # bearCommander "Excuse me, Sir. Are you involved in this matter?"
    bearCommander "失礼了，先生。您和这件事有关吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_209707be:

    # e "Uh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_6a8e21d2:

    # bearGuard "He's a traveller, he was just here when we were chasing Herd."
    bearGuard "他是个旅行者，我们追赫德的时候，他刚好在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_fbe5eba3:

    # bearCommander "I see... Okay. You may need to follow us to see Chief Kaurhu, it will take only a while."
    bearCommander "我明白了……好吧。你可能得跟我们去见考尔胡酋长，不过不会花太久时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d0e23e7b:

    # e "C-come with you? I have no idea who you people are, I just got here."
    e "跟你们走？我根本不知道你们是什么人，我才刚到这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_02e8b8fc:

    # bearCommander "Our chief would like to know what happened here, please, follow me."
    bearCommander "我们的酋长想知道这里发生了什么。请跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_4533b03b:

    # "You hear a clear yet deep note as he raises the horn to his lips and blows softly."
    "你听见一声清亮却深沉的号角声，那名守卫将号角举到唇边，轻轻吹响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_779bb16c:

    # "You can feel the whole forest vibrating, resonating through the whole snow-covered ground. You can already sense more guards are coming."
    "你能感觉到整片森林都在颤动，震鸣声透过覆满积雪的大地传来。你已经察觉到，更多守卫正在赶来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_127fae5d:

    # bearCommander "You two, stay with Herd until the rest arrive, I will take the stranger to Chief Kaurhu."
    bearCommander "你们两个留下来陪着赫德，直到其他人赶到。我带这个陌生人去见考尔胡酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_707363e6:

    # "The two guards standing by you, exchange glances in silence, before they turn back to the commander."
    "站在你身边的两名守卫默默交换了眼神，然后转身面向指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b11a6b58:

    # bearGuard "Yes, commander."
    bearGuard "是，指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5c09dfca:

    # "The white bear nods, and he turns to you, gesturing for you to follow him."
    "白熊点了点头，转身面向你，示意你跟上他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_97499c32:

    # "He leads you through the snow-covered wilderness, as you show some form of discomfort."
    "他带着你穿过白雪覆盖的荒野，而你显得有些不适。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7c5435a2:

    # bearCommander "Hey, what's your name?"
    bearCommander "嘿，你叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5031b55a:

    # e "[e]."
    e "[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_66768ba4:

    # "He taps your shoulder, signaling for you to walk beside him."
    "他轻拍你的肩膀，示意你走到他身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d6624356:

    # d "My name's Daggi, the commander of the bear tribe."
    d "我叫达吉，是熊族的指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_9fc5aeac:

    # e "Shouldn't we be walking along with the other guards?"
    e "我们不是应该和其他卫兵一起走吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_78c1a5b3:

    # d "No, the guards are scared of Chief right now. and I am their commander, so it should be me who break the news first."
    d "不，卫兵们现在都怕酋长。而我是他们的指挥官，所以应该由我先把消息告诉他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_6d318305:

    # "You nod, and follow the white bear as he leads you through the forest."
    "你点了点头，跟在那头白熊身后，任由他带着你穿过森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_faea0369:

    # d "The hooded man you just saw, his name was Herd."
    d "你刚才看到的那个戴兜帽的人叫赫德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_033a733d:

    # d "I... well... I'm not sure how to explain this, but all you needed to know was we needed to talk to him."
    d "我……嗯……不太确定该怎么解释，但你只需要知道，我们得和他谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5ce7d8ac:

    # e "Was he bad?"
    e "他是坏人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_1e2d80df:

    # d "No! No... he was our architect. He designed most of the mechanical structures in our tribe, made sure they won't collapse and all."
    d "不！不……他是我们的建筑师。他设计了族里大多数机械结构，还确保它们不会坍塌什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a506da17:

    # d "But, ever since the avalanche..."
    d "但是，自从那场雪崩之后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_6f1d3d44:

    # "Commander Daggi ponders for a moment, his expression darkening as he recalls the events of the past few days."
    "达吉指挥官沉思片刻，回忆起过去几天发生的事情，神情逐渐阴沉下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d80d673d:

    # d "He just didn't deserve to be killed, and I believed he was merely lost in the moment."
    d "他不该就这样被杀，我还以为他只是一时迷失了方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_cdbff688:

    # e "I'm sorry."
    e "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_bf3b0151:

    # "You turn to the white bear, who stares forward blankly."
    "你转向那头白熊，只见他面无表情地望着前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_96fd9b1b:

    # d "M-maybe we should keep going."
    d "我、我们也许该继续走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_3156cef1:

    # "After some time, the thick taiga giving way to a well-trodden path that winds its way down into a snow-filled valley."
    "过了一阵，茂密的泰加林让出一条人迹踩踏的小路，蜿蜒向下通入积雪覆盖的山谷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_604182cc:

    # "The tall pine trees gradually thin out, replaced by the sprawling landscape of the village around, and below."
    "高耸的松树渐渐变得稀疏，取而代之的是四周以及下方绵延铺展的村庄景色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_418fda52:

    # "Already you hear loud clanking sounds, some wooden wheels are spinning by themselves, with carts full of goods sprawling around the village."
    "你已经听见响亮的铿锵声；一些木轮自行转动着，载满货物的板车散布在村子各处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_9c216a74:

    # "With a begrudging wave from the commander, the guards escort you back toward their village, their frosty silence punctuated only by the loudness of the village itself."
    "指挥官不情不愿地挥了挥手，卫兵们护送你回到他们的村子；他们冰冷的沉默，只有村庄本身的喧闹声打破。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f80d273e:

    # d "This is our small town, please make yourself at home, we won't bite, or maul."
    d "这是我们的小镇，请把这里当成自己家。放心，我们不会咬你，也不会把你撕碎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f86814ad:

    # e "I don't doubt that."
    e "这点我倒不怀疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_3b27e664:

    # d "The Chief is downstairs. Please follow me."
    d "酋长就在楼下。请跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_da672993:

    # "The roof of their houses are covered in thick snow, and you're soon led up a flight of snowy stairs, leading to a bridge that stands over the icy chasm."
    "他们房屋的屋顶都覆着厚厚的积雪。很快，你便被带上一段积雪覆盖的楼梯，通向一座横跨冰冷深渊的桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_54e5e2f3:

    # "The Chief's Hall awaits on the other side of the bridge, a formidable structure just like the others, albeit much more grandiose."
    "桥的另一边便是酋长大厅，一座和其他建筑一样气势逼人的建筑，只是宏伟得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_2e70bce7:

    # "Daggi gestures for you to follow him, and you walk across the bridge, the icy wind biting at your fur."
    "达吉示意你跟上他。你走过桥，冰冷的寒风刺痛着你的皮毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_64a4dfcf:

    # d "I will explain the situation very briefly to the Chief, you just need to follow my lead, [e]."
    d "我会把情况非常简短地向酋长说明，你只要跟着我的安排就行，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_5fb4aa30:

    # e "Alright, I suppose it will be quick and easy?"
    e "好吧，我想应该会很快，也很容易吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_672c4768:

    # d "Depends on who you ask, but I'll try to make it as painless as possible."
    d "这得看你问的是谁，不过我会尽量让过程没那么难受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_8e0ffa7a:

    # "Inside the council, you hear a few coughing sound from within the settlement. A chair surrounded by advisors and elders discussing, some carrying towels."
    "议事厅里，你听见聚落中传来几声咳嗽。顾问和长老们围着一把椅子议论着什么，其中一些人手里还拿着毛巾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_1977dc4d:

    # "As you enter, the room suddenly falls silent, the weight of their collective gaze upon you and the guards."
    "你一走进去，整个房间骤然安静下来，所有人的目光沉甸甸地落在你和卫兵们身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_04514cea:

    # d "Chief, I'm back."
    d "酋长，我回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_c435d1aa:

    # "A voice calls for the chief as you see the commander runs up in front of the throne."
    "你看见指挥官跑到王座前，同时有人出声呼唤酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d65cc3c3:

    # "On the throne sits an old brown bear, one whose wrinkles etch deep into his weathered face. He coughs once more, drawing the attention of the young commander."
    "王座上坐着一头年迈的棕熊，饱经风霜的脸上刻满了深深的皱纹。他又咳了一声，引得年轻的指挥官看向他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_ea3b6a54:

    # bearChief "Great."
    bearChief "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_4eec777d:

    # "His beard, a cascade of icy white, messily hangs around the brownish stubbles."
    "他那冰雪般洁白的胡须杂乱地垂落在棕色的胡茬周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f339ed94:

    # "The brown bear looks around, seemingly searching for someone other than you and the commander."
    "棕熊环顾四周，似乎在寻找除你和指挥官之外的其他人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_730f1e04:

    # bearChief "Where is the rest of the guards? Did you catch Herd?"
    bearChief "其他卫兵呢？你抓到赫德了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_ffe00dd0:

    # "The brown bear clears his throat, then glances at the commander briefly."
    "棕熊清了清嗓子，然后短暂地瞥了指挥官一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_4bfa236c:

    # d "Chief Kaurhu..."
    d "卡乌胡酋长……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_cd1541ef:

    # "The commander averts his gaze, his expression darkening as he tries to find a word to explain."
    "指挥官移开视线，脸色阴沉下来，努力寻找合适的话来解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_3ddbc99f:

    # kh "What's the matter? Where's that sack of shit, shouldn't he be rotting in my prison ten minutes ago?"
    kh "怎么回事？那坨狗屎在哪儿？十分钟前他不就该在我的牢里烂着了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_cfe1b6ac:

    # d "Herd is dead."
    d "赫德死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_23d66e04:

    # kh "What?"
    kh "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a2aaefa8:

    # d "They are taking Herd's body back here."
    d "他们正把赫德的尸体带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_d612d9f8:

    # kh "H-how?"
    kh "怎、怎么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_c6a3467a:

    # d "H-he tried to run, I mean, Gren and Illoch were losing him, a-and we accidentally..."
    d "他、他想逃跑，我是说，格伦和伊洛克快要跟丢他了，而、而我们一不小心……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_539ce24c:

    # d "...killed him."
    d "……杀了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_3f3ba6d5:

    # d "This stranger was there too, he can attest for my claim, Chief Kaurhu."
    d "这个陌生人当时也在场，他可以证明我说的是真的，卡乌胡酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_50afd1d4:

    # e "Uhm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_af96ba3c:

    # "Daggi takes a deep breath as the entire room turn their attention to you."
    "达吉深吸一口气，整个房间的人都将注意力转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a081d382:

    # "The elders around the chief look at one another, then they scatter and walk away, revealing the old chief slumped against the throne, raising his brows."
    "酋长身边的长老们彼此对视，随后四散走开，露出倚在王座旁、抬起眉毛的老酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_aeda43cc:

    # kh "Explain yourself."
    kh "说清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_a64bfa76:

    # "The chief slouches over, his eyes are fixed on you, waiting for your response."
    "酋长懒散地靠着，目光牢牢锁定你，等着你的回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f97f7c8e:

    # e "Yes, the commander is correct, Chief."
    e "是的，指挥官说得没错，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_bea4d7b2:

    # kh "Where are you from, traveller?"
    kh "旅行者，你从哪里来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_ca5ce0e0:

    # e "I'm from Lusterfield, Chief. I was just passing by when I saw the guards chasing after someone."
    e "我来自卢斯特菲尔德，酋长。我只是路过时，看见卫兵正在追赶某个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_2cfc1041:

    # kh "What else did you see?"
    kh "你还看到了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_2629d267:

    # e "The guards saw him running further down the hill, and one of them hurls a harpoon towards his direction."
    e "卫兵看见他继续往山下跑，其中一人朝他的方向掷出鱼叉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_39ef0673:

    # e "He was running at the time, but when I arrived, Herd was already lying on the snow, on top of a pool of blood, he probably bled out."
    e "当时他还在跑，但我赶到时，赫德已经躺在雪地上，身下是一滩血，大概是失血过多而死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_2d231006:

    # kh "Ugh..."
    kh "唉……"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_e05ea5b6:

    # "The chief sighs as he straightens his body."
    "酋长叹了口气，挺直身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_855b363e:

    # kh "Poor bastard, he lost his family and lost himself."
    kh "可怜的家伙，他失去了家人，也迷失了自我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b2c8b151:

    # d "Illoch and the others are bringing him back now. I am sorry, Chief."
    d "伊洛克和其他人现在正把他带回来。对不起，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_c954eaa0:

    # kh "No, no. You're doing fine, commander. I'm not blaming you for this."
    kh "不，不。你做得很好，指挥官。我没有怪你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_6cc7afc7:

    # d "It was just an accident, Chief. Please, do not blame it on the guards too."
    d "这只是场意外，酋长。请不要也把责任怪到卫兵头上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_284cad06:

    # kh "How many accidents do we need to make before we learn, Daggi?"
    kh "我们还要造成多少起意外，才会吸取教训，达吉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_6185c055:

    # kh "I'm not blaming you, but I need you to understand the weight of one's actions, we're talking about Herd who we lost here."
    kh "我不是在责怪你，但我要你明白一个人的行为有多么沉重；我们说的是在这里失去的赫德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_e1ec5dd5:

    # "The chief coughs loudly, before turning to you with a rougher voice."
    "酋长重重咳嗽一声，然后转向你，嗓音变得更加粗厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_8a42e3c1:

    # kh "You, what's your name?"
    kh "你，叫什么名字？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b81630a4:

    # e "My name is [e], chief. I'm a courier from Lusterfield."
    e "我叫[e]，酋长。我是来自卢斯特菲尔德的信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_c7497259:

    # kh "Oh, a courier, got any letters for me?"
    kh "哦，信使？有我的信吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_7b720758:

    # e "N-no... I was just travelling by."
    e "不、不……我只是路过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_3afd34dd:

    # "Kaurhu shakes his head."
    "考尔胡摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_b441eb64:

    # kh "Great."
    kh "很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_dd070f5b:

    # "As he clears his throats, you can hear the footsteps of the guards outside."
    "他清了清嗓子，你听见外面卫兵的脚步声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_f3f1286e:

    # kh "Commander, escort [e] out of our tribe, quietly. I'll need some time to talk with your folks."
    kh "指挥官，悄悄把[e]送出我们部落。我还需要些时间和你们的人谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_e8653cd0:

    # kh "We'll talk about this later."
    kh "我们之后再谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_68b42240:

    # d "Yes, chief."
    d "是，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_315eafbb:

    # "Commander Daggi stands behind you, and gestures to lead you the way."
    "指挥官达吉站在你身后，示意你跟着他走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Chase_eea9ee39:

    # d "This way, [e]."
    d "这边，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_d1e3c0a6:

    # "As you are escorted out of the Council Hall by the commander, you can't help but notice the simmering tension that still lingers among the guards outside."
    "指挥官护送你离开议事厅时，你不禁注意到外面的卫兵之间仍弥漫着一触即发的紧张气氛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_ede7768f:

    # bearGuard "Filthy outsider."
    bearGuard "肮脏的外来者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_0c448d58:

    # "The guard standing nearby taunts, crossing their arms, they're clearly disturbed with the chief letting you go scot-free."
    "附近的卫兵抱着双臂出言嘲讽，显然对酋长放你逍遥离开感到不满。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_21c127a0:

    # d "Show some respect to our guest, Chief has made his mind, or do you want to change that?"
    d "对我们的客人放尊重点。酋长已经做了决定，还是说你想让他改变主意？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_aef48430:

    # "He rolls his eyes, returning to exchange series of murmurs you can barely faintly hear."
    "他翻了个白眼，又和其他人低声嘀咕起来，声音轻得你几乎听不清。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_0fe624ad:

    # "You follow the commander idly, who's leading the way out."
    "你百无聊赖地跟着带路离开的指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_ae32d696:

    # d "Sorry for their behaviour, they can be hot-headed, sometimes."
    d "抱歉，他们有时就是容易冲动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_e00365d5:

    # e "And thanks for helping me, I'd not know what to do if you weren't there."
    e "还有，谢谢你帮了我。要不是你在那儿，我真不知道该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_b2064a9a:

    # d "That's the least I can do."
    d "这是我应该做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_ba34cdfb:

    # "He glances at you sincerely."
    "他真诚地看了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_025517fd:

    # e "You still hadn't answered me, who is Herd?"
    e "你还没回答我，赫德是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_56c68f3a:

    # d "He was the former architect of the tribe, he designed and helped construct most mechanical structures in our tribe."
    d "他曾是部落的建筑师，设计并协助建造了我们部落的大多数机械结构。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_0483774c:

    # d "The wheels, the rails, he took up the difficult job to make use of our abundant resources. We were thankful of him at the time."
    d "车轮、轨道，都是他接下了利用我们丰富资源的艰巨工作。那时候我们都很感激他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_dcc28471:

    # e "Then, why are you trying to catch him now?"
    e "那么，你们现在为什么还要抓他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_ea4ae440:

    # d "Did the answer satisfy you?"
    d "这个回答令你满意吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_866dbcca:

    # e "You answered more than I expected, truly. You know you're escorting me out of this land, right?"
    e "你的回答确实比我预想的多。你知道自己是在把我送出这片土地，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_f2781f20:

    # e "Are you expecting me to come back?"
    e "你是指望我回来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_1cec4d79:

    # "The white bear smiles, but he remains silent."
    "白熊笑了笑，但没有说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_7eb092ea:

    # d "That's your choice to make, [e]. I'm sure Chief Kaurhu won't bite your head off if you ever come back."
    d "这由你决定，[e]。我相信你要是有朝一日回来，酋长考尔胡也不会把你的脑袋咬下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_7182c529:

    # "You try to justify Daggi's intention, there is no way a commander's treating a stranger this well, without any reason."
    "你试图为达吉的意图找个理由：指挥官不可能无缘无故对一个陌生人这么好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_460e22cf:

    # "Unless perhaps, he's trying to use someone to tame his guards. You try to go along with suspicion, but his affectionate smile has already melted your heart."
    "除非……他是想利用某个人来驯服自己的守卫。你试着顺着这个疑虑想下去，可他那亲切的笑容已经融化了你的心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_5d9270bd:

    # e "Thanks, Commander Daggi."
    e "谢谢你，达吉指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_e4417459:

    # "He pauses as you two have reached the forest where Herd was last seen. Some guards from distant are still looking for the man."
    "你们抵达赫德最后被发现的森林时，他停下脚步。远处仍有几名守卫在寻找那个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_e4e6ebba:

    # d "I will be around the forest until Herd is caught. Before that, if you want to come, stay with me and don't get yourself caught by the guards first."
    d "在抓到赫德之前，我会一直待在森林附近。要是你想跟来，就先跟着我，别先被守卫抓住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_146766df:

    # d "See you around, then."
    d "那就回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_f50bdbc6:

    # "As you are escorted out of the Council Hall by the commander, you take notice of the guards outside, along with a sack the size of a normal bear."
    "在指挥官护送你走出议事厅时，你注意到外面的守卫，以及旁边一个有普通熊那么大的袋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_1d747fb3:

    # "The guards are still discussing among themselves, they glance at you and the commander, before entering the hall."
    "守卫们还在彼此交谈。他们瞥了你和指挥官一眼，便走进了大厅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_d215513f:

    # d "Sorry for the troubles you've been through, [e]."
    d "让你经历这些麻烦，真是抱歉，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_02c1e7b4:

    # e "It's fine, I guess I didn't expect this to be my first-time experience with the bear tribe."
    e "没关系吧，我只是没想到自己第一次接触熊族会是这种经历。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_7e7e35ad:

    # "You chuckle, but the commander remains silent."
    "你轻笑了一声，但指挥官依旧沉默不语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_2fb17b1c:

    # d "I hope you forgive us for the trouble, we're not usually like this. Everyone has been on edge ever since the avalanche."
    d "希望你能原谅我们给你带来的麻烦，我们平时不是这样的。自从雪崩发生后，大家一直都很紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_52e5f342:

    # e "What happened in the avalanche?"
    e "雪崩里发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_70d85d22:

    # d "Oh, uhm, I didn't mean to dump this all onto you, [e]."
    d "哦，呃，我不是想把这些事一股脑都倒给你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_a86b0afb:

    # e "It's fine, but it did make me feel a little worse knowing this... Herd."
    e "没关系，不过知道这些……赫德，还是让我心里更不好受了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_d870e3bf:

    # "The commander takes a deep breath, then turns to you."
    "指挥官深深吸了口气，然后转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_47c8ce6e:

    # d "When the dust settles, I hope to see you visit us again, perhaps I can be your guide around the tribe, as my personal apology."
    d "等事情平息后，希望还能再见到你，也许我可以亲自带你逛逛我们的部落，算是我的赔礼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_61338293:

    # e "Are you sure? I don't want to be a burden to the Commander of the tribe."
    e "你确定吗？我不想给部落指挥官添麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_fbdc1d1a:

    # d "I insist, it's the least I can do for my guest."
    d "我坚持，这是我能为客人做的最起码的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_7182c529_1:

    # "You try to justify Daggi's intention, there is no way a commander's treating a stranger this well, without any reason."
    "你试图为达吉的意图找个理由：指挥官不可能无缘无故对一个陌生人这么好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_7068629e:

    # "But staring at his sincere eyes, you can't help but to trust the valiant commander."
    "但望着他真诚的双眼，你还是不由得信任起这位英勇的指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_cdb2e7c5:

    # d "The guards will be patrolling the area around here, try not to get caught by them."
    d "守卫会在这一带巡逻，你尽量别被他们抓住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_302e52cf:

    # d "I hope to see you around, [e]."
    d "希望还能再见到你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_6186867a_1:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Otsovaara_Introduction_Aftermath_5d9270bd_1:

    # e "Thanks, Commander Daggi."
    e "谢谢你，达吉指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_7cbceee3:

    # "Daggi goes still for a moment, the set of his shoulders tightening as he gathers the words."
    "达吉停了一会儿，肩膀逐渐绷紧，似乎正在斟酌该说些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_e9122ae7:

    # d "There was a snowfall from the mountain not long ago. It became an avalanche before anyone could answer it properly."
    d "不久前，山上降了场雪。还没等我们做出妥善应对，它就变成了雪崩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_b69a6a32:

    # d "We lost many people that day."
    d "那天我们失去了很多人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_7a2c83db:

    # e "I'm sorry for your tribe's loss."
    e "很遗憾你们部族遭遇了这样的损失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_14b7b944:

    # d "Herd's house was buried. When we found it, his family was still inside."
    d "赫德的房子被埋了。我们找到时，他的家人还在里面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_82ec9292:

    # d "He was there too, kneeling in the snow and staring at the wreck as if he could still force it to come undone by looking at it long enough."
    d "他当时也在那里，跪在雪地里盯着那片废墟，仿佛只要一直盯着看，就能凭自己的意志让它重新恢复原状。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_47fef134:

    # d "I do not think any of us knew what to say to him after that."
    d "在那之后，我想我们谁也不知道该对他说些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_6cf1c8ab:

    # d "The avalanche injured him as well. His hearing was badly damaged. Afterward, he could not hear us, and he would barely look at us long enough to try."
    d "雪崩也伤到了他。他的听力严重受损。之后，他听不见我们说话，也几乎不会看我们一眼，哪怕只是为了尝试交流。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_0d5ce15c:

    # d "He stopped eating properly. Stopped sleeping. He would not speak, and when anyone approached him, he looked as if he was bracing for another wall of snow."
    d "他不再好好吃饭，也不再睡觉。他不肯说话，而每当有人靠近，他看上去就像是在准备迎接又一堵雪墙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_6e677b90:

    # "Daggi exhales slowly, not quite looking at you."
    "达吉缓缓呼出一口气，没有完全看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_515f9c9d:

    # d "We tried to make room for him. That sounds pitiful when I say it aloud, but we did try."
    d "我们试着给他腾出容身之处。我这么说出来听着挺可怜的，但我们确实努力过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_de1a6b43:

    # d "In the end he returned to what was left of the house, and after that he would hardly communicate with anyone at all."
    d "最后，他回到了那所房子仅存的残骸中。自那以后，他几乎不再和任何人交流。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_0a8b4027:

    # e "That came out of nowhere."
    e "这话题转得也太突然了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_255e54e9:

    # d "I think he blamed us, at least in part. Maybe for the avalanche. Maybe for surviving it badly. Maybe for failing to reach him after."
    d "我想，他至少有一部分是在责怪我们。也许是因为那场雪崩，也许是因为我们没能好好熬过那场灾难，也许是因为灾难之后我们没能找到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_4aef3cd2:

    # d "I cannot say he was wrong to grieve. He lost his whole family, and then most of the world went silent on him."
    d "我不能说他不该悲伤。他失去了自己的整个家庭，之后世上的大多数人也都对他陷入了沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_0f4caf58:

    # d "The Herd I knew before that was patient, reassuring, and wiser than most of the tribe gave him credit for."
    d "在那之前我认识的赫德，耐心、可靠，而且比部族大多数人认为的更加睿智。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_0d442206:

    # d "He advised Chief Kaurhu often. He built half the things in this settlement that still stand straight in winter."
    d "他经常为卡乌胡酋长出谋划策。这个聚居地里，至今能在冬天稳稳挺立的一半建筑，都是他建造的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_7666f08f:

    # d "After the avalanche, he was not the same. He kept to himself. Sat near the furnace through the night. Watched everyone as if waiting for something worse."
    d "雪崩之后，他就变得不一样了。他把自己封闭起来，整夜坐在炉子旁，注视着所有人，仿佛在等待更糟糕的事情发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_dd106483:

    # d "Then yesterday he got into the council hall somehow. Chief Kaurhu caught him near his room before anyone understood how far he had already made it."
    d "然后就在昨天，他不知怎么闯进了议事厅。卡乌胡酋长在自己的房间附近抓住了他，那时我们还没人弄清楚他已经走了多远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_4c7c3fd2:

    # e "Did he try to do anything?"
    e "他有没有试图做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_bdc44e9d:

    # d "Not that I saw. That is part of what made it worse."
    d "至少我没看到。这也是事情变得更糟的原因之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_11abde82:

    # d "We could not question him properly. We could not calm him. We cornered him because we did not know what else to do, and he escaped anyway."
    d "我们没法好好盘问他，也没法让他冷静下来。我们不知道还能怎么办，只好把他逼到角落里，可他还是逃走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_cdcd96b9:

    # d "Even now I am still not sure how he got out of the council hall with guards at every door."
    d "直到现在，我也不明白议事厅每扇门都有守卫，他究竟是怎么逃出去的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_55cc409d:

    # d "After that, one of the patrols saw him trying to flee the tribe, so they gave chase into the forest."
    d "之后，一支巡逻队发现他正试图逃离部族，于是便追进了森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Asking_About_Herd_7ebc7b49:

    # d "And you already know what happened next."
    d "接下来发生了什么，你已经知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_2c474a62:

    # "As you walk up to the throne. The brown bear catches you in his peripherals, but only notices your presences after a few blinks."
    "你走近王座时，那头棕熊从眼角瞥见了你，却眨了几下眼才注意到你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_7bf1aafa:

    # kh "Oh, great, the courier is back. I thought I told you we are not accepting any visitors."
    kh "哦，真棒，信使又回来了。我不是告诉过你，我们不接待任何访客吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_220ad570:

    # e "I-I'm sorry, Chief Kaurhu, I think Commander Daggi didn't mind that."
    e "对、对不起，考尔胡酋长，我想达吉指挥官并不介意这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_c8fca389:

    # kh "I don't care what Daggi said, I'm the chief here, and I say we're not accepting any visitors."
    kh "我不在乎达吉说了什么，我才是这里的酋长，我说不接待访客，就是不接待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_22ef990f:

    # e "Sorry, I will leave right away."
    e "抱歉，我这就离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_6ce34af3:

    # kh "Good..."
    kh "好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_e44c782f:

    # "The chief furrows his brows as you turn back."
    "酋长见你转身，眉头皱了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_d0b8690e:

    # kh "Is a proper courier supposed to be this spinelessly subservient?"
    kh "一个合格的信使，难道就该如此没骨气地卑躬屈膝吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_b6cab2b3:

    # e "Huh? I-I'm sorry, Chief Kaurhu."
    e "啊？对、对不起，考尔胡酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_2da19a23:

    # kh "I will make an exception this time, but only because you're a courier and Daggi vouched for you."
    kh "这次我就破例，但只是因为你是信使，而且达吉替你担保。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_890f4f32:

    # kh "You can come back if you have any letters for me, but don't step in this place if you have nothing."
    kh "你要是有信给我，可以再回来；但如果什么都没有，就别踏进这里一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_d91a8a40:

    # e "I understand, Chief Kaurhu."
    e "我明白了，考尔胡酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_b454cfc5:

    # kh "Now, leave."
    kh "现在，离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_65c62128:

    # "You nod, and quickly leave the hall."
    "你点了点头，迅速离开大厅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_811a276c:

    # kh "It's you again, Courier, got any letters for me?"
    kh "又是你啊，信使，有给我的信吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_fa98aee4:

    # e "N-no..."
    e "没、没有……"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_31a1fb08:

    # "The bear chief sighs, slightly raising the edge of his lips, as if he's been expecting it."
    "熊族酋长叹了口气，嘴角微微上扬，仿佛早就料到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Dialogue_1c9a80e7:

    # kh "Then you better speak up, [e]. I don't have all day."
    kh "那你最好开口说清楚，[e]。我可没一整天的时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_6df33d66:

    # kh "What is it that you have to say?" nointeract
    kh "你想说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_ce2a733e:

    # e "What's the relationship between your tribe and the other villages? We haven't heard much about the bears around here."
    e "你们部落和其他村庄之间是什么关系？我们没怎么听说过这一带的熊族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_3b74e25e:

    # kh "I take pride in not relying on anyone else."
    kh "我以不依靠任何人为傲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_61e6b0c1:

    # kh "I have my own resources, my own people, and my own land. I don't need anyone else to tell me what to do."
    kh "我有自己的资源、自己的族人，还有自己的土地。我不需要别人来告诉我该怎么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_e1dd7ee1:

    # kh "I can see you pulling down your brows, got any problems with that?"
    kh "我看得出来你皱起了眉头，有什么问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_4cfb3008:

    # e "No, no, I was just surprised. Don't you have outside friends... or allies?"
    e "不，不，我只是有点惊讶。你在外面没有朋友……或者盟友吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b474ee28:

    # kh "Look, the only reason you aren't denied entry like everyone else is because you are a courier, who passes me letters, now do that job and stop pestering me about stupid questions."
    kh "听着，你之所以没有像其他人一样被拒之门外，只是因为你是个替我传递信件的信使。现在去做好你的工作，别再拿这些愚蠢的问题来烦我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_0bda92d5:

    # e "I-I'm sorry, Chief Kaurhu, I didn't mean it like that."
    e "对、对不起，考尔胡酋长，我不是那个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_468a6aac:

    # kh "I accept your apology."
    kh "我接受你的道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_1fc035d0:

    # "He grumbles, then turns back to the throne."
    "他嘟囔了几句，然后转身面向王座。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_275abe5a:

    # kh "You are not the first one to ask me that, and you won't be the last."
    kh "你不是第一个问我这个问题的人，也不会是最后一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_f468fce8:

    # e "Well, I'm sorry for asking."
    e "好吧，抱歉问了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_23276c05:

    # kh "The fact is, they either are too far away, or never got used to the weather."
    kh "事实是，他们要么离得太远，要么就是从没适应这里的天气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_33c4933a:

    # kh "That is why I never bothered talking with some annoying sullen sorts and what not. We have enough to worry about."
    kh "所以我从没费心去和那些烦人又阴郁的家伙之类的人打交道。我们要操心的事已经够多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_3619812c:

    # e "I heard rumors about your retirement, Chief Kaurhu. Is that true?"
    e "我听说了你要退休的传闻，考尔胡酋长。是真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_150c36ba:

    # kh "Retirement? Who told you that?"
    kh "退休？谁告诉你的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_88214de8:

    # e "I-I heard it from the guards, they said you were planning to retire, but that avalanche got in the way."
    e "我、我是从卫兵那里听来的，他们说你正打算退休，但那场雪崩阻止了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_638f1c0b:

    # kh "The guards, huh? They're always talking about something they don't understand."
    kh "卫兵，嗯？他们总是在谈论自己根本不了解的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_11a80292:

    # kh "I'm not abdicating. I'm not going anywhere, I'm staying here, and I'm not going to let anyone else take my place."
    kh "我不会退位。我哪儿也不去，我会留在这里，也不会让任何人取代我的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_4ab7cb0c:

    # e "Not even your son?"
    e "连你的儿子也不行？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_3ec6979a:

    # kh "Daggi? He's not ready to take my place. I love him, and all, but he's not born to lead the tribe."
    kh "达吉？他还没准备好接替我的位置。虽说我疼爱他，但他不是天生的部落领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_01141f60:

    # e "That was surprising, do you not trust your own son?"
    e "这倒让我很惊讶，你难道不信任自己的儿子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_63f1b125:

    # kh "I trust him when he's playing wooden blocks in my room, not when he's leading the bears who had no trust in him."
    kh "他在我的房间里玩木头积木时，我信任他；可让他去领导那些不信任他的熊族，我就不信了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_63a8d2d6:

    # kh "I know my son better than anyone else, he is not ready to be a leader, not yet, at least."
    kh "我比任何人都了解我的儿子，他还没准备好成为领袖，至少现在还没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_a21dbb5c:

    # kh "The fact is, as soon as he's sitting on my throne, the outsider boars are going to eat my tribe alive."
    kh "事实是，他一旦坐上我的王座，那些外来的野猪就会把我的部落活活吃光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_a7b75aeb:

    # kh "I'll stay here until he's ready, but I can't see that happening anytime soon."
    kh "我会留在这里，直到他准备好为止，但我看这短期内是不可能发生了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_c8c65226:

    # e "Daggi told me about the avalanche, Chief Kaurhu. What happened on that day?"
    e "达吉告诉过我那场雪崩的事，考尔胡酋长。那天发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_29103c70:

    # kh "I thought Commander had already told you what I had to say."
    kh "我还以为指挥官已经把我想说的话告诉你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_9adf408a:

    # e "Uh, he did, but I want to hear it from you, Chief. If that is fine."
    e "呃，他确实说了，但我想听你亲口告诉我，酋长。如果你不介意的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_c0c32dfe:

    # kh "Look, I don't need you spreading around the news outside, that gives me more headaches than you being here."
    kh "听着，我不需要你把消息传到外面去，那会比你待在这里给我带来更多麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_4972a349:

    # e "Of course not, Chief. I'm just curious about what happened."
    e "当然不是，酋长。我只是好奇发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_56bf9466:

    # kh "Fine. What do you want to know?"
    kh "好吧。你想知道什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_e5dae52b:

    # e "How did the avalanche happen?"
    e "雪崩是怎么发生的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_75734b49:

    # kh "Because there were a snowstorm earlier, the snow was piling up on the mountain ranges, and then it came crashing down."
    kh "因为之前下过一场暴风雪，积雪堆积在山脉上，后来就轰然坍塌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_ebd9abb1:

    # e "Was it common in the snow region?"
    e "这种事在雪域很常见吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_f718428d:

    # kh "No, not at all. My people have always prepared for snowslides. They've been living here for generations, they know how to handle it."
    kh "不，完全不常见。我的族人一直为雪崩做好准备。他们世世代代生活在这里，知道该如何应对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_9a6fafe1:

    # kh "But the day it happened, there were some, unusual circumstances in the tribe. The guards responsible were somehow caught... off guard."
    kh "不过，事发当天，部落里出现了一些不同寻常的情况。负责守卫的卫兵不知怎么竟然……毫无防备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_9b4f7d70:

    # e "The guards?"
    e "守卫？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_df7ce16c:

    # kh "There are signs of avalanche where you can predict such things hours before it happens. But on the day it happened, the guards were distracted."
    kh "雪崩发生前会有征兆，能让人提前数小时预知。但事发当天，守卫们分了心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b3ff3318:

    # kh "And then, the snow came crashing down."
    kh "然后，积雪就轰然坍塌了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_c09221da:

    # e "So, you're saying they are responsible for the avalanche?"
    e "所以，你是说他们要为这场雪崩负责？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_891244bf:

    # kh "No, not all of them. Commander Bedwyr, he was the one who was supposed to be on duty that day, he failed the tribe when it matters the most."
    kh "不，不是所有人。贝德维尔指挥官本该在那天值守，却在最关键的时候辜负了族人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_25d77274:

    # e "What happened to him?"
    e "他后来怎么样了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_1c541606:

    # kh "I sent him to the prison. He's been there ever since, and he's not coming out any time soon."
    kh "我把他送进了监狱。他一直待在那里，短时间内别想出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_67b8cca8:

    # e "Isn't that a bit too harsh, Chief? I don't think he was solely responsible for the tragedy."
    e "酋长，这是不是有点太严厉了？我不认为这场灾难完全是他的责任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_c54ac78b:

    # kh "I don't care what you think, courier. My people died because of his incompetence, someone had to pay for this."
    kh "我不在乎你怎么想，信使。我的族人因他的无能而死，总得有人为此付出代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_542ee4af:

    # kh "Yeah, I'm done talking about this."
    kh "是的，我不想再谈这件事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_7f1f6353:

    # e "Chief Kaurhu, can you tell me more about the bear tribe?"
    e "卡乌胡酋长，你能再告诉我一些熊族的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_6e823ff0:

    # kh "You need to be more specific, courier. I have a tribe to rule."
    kh "你得问得具体些，信使。我还有一个部落要治理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_889be5ed:

    # e "O-okay, what about the bear tribe's history?"
    e "好、好的，那熊族的历史呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_9a42181e:

    # kh "Well, you see. The bear tribe, or in my people's tongue - Otsovaara, has been around since before the ancient times."
    kh "嗯，你看。熊族，或者用我们族人的语言说——奥措瓦拉，在远古时代以前就已经存在了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_09d14f63:

    # kh "We are the descendants of the great snow bear, Ookko. That's why we're the only few who can survive in this cold."
    kh "我们是伟大雪熊奥科的后裔。这就是为什么只有我们少数人能在这片严寒中生存。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_303e7e7b:

    # e "What about the other tribe in the snow region? I saw them on the map."
    e "那雪域里的另一个部落呢？我在地图上看到过他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_d5d16517:

    # kh "The boars? They're a bunch of thick-furred pigs who think they can take over my land. Just nothing but savages who can't even handle a snowstorm like a true bear."
    kh "野猪族？一群自以为能夺走我领地的厚毛猪。只不过是一帮野蛮人，连场暴风雪都扛不住，根本比不上真正的熊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_55565088:

    # e "Uhm... What was the history between you two?"
    e "呃……你们两个之间究竟有什么渊源？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_2ebfbee3:

    # "Kaurhu chuckles, his eyes gleaming with pride as he recounts the tale of his ancestors."
    "卡乌胡轻笑起来，讲述祖先的故事时，眼中闪烁着自豪的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_8825569f:

    # kh "There were a time when the bears and the boars shared the land, but they were too greedy, they wanted more than what they already have."
    kh "曾经，熊族和野猪族共享这片土地，但它们太贪婪了，想要的远不止自己已有的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_3dc4b496:

    # kh "Long story short, an ancient war broke out, and the conqueror, my ancestor, Stigandr sacrificed himself, and led the bears to victory."
    kh "长话短说，一场古老的战争爆发了。征服者、我的祖先斯蒂甘德牺牲了自己，带领熊族取得了胜利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_1394317c:

    # kh "Ever since his death, the region has been under the protection of his spirit, there were no snowstorms, or avalanche, and the boars have never dared to step foot on our land again."
    kh "自他死后，这片地区一直受到他灵魂的庇护，再也没有暴风雪或雪崩，野猪族也再不敢踏入我们的土地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_7d4ad8bb:

    # e "Was the warrior really that powerful?"
    e "那位战士真的有那么强大吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_6671f590:

    # kh "Not sure, it was an old story from my ancestors, I don't believe in gods or spirit, I believe in my people, and my tribe."
    kh "我不确定，那只是祖先流传下来的古老故事。我不相信神明或灵魂，我只相信我的族人和我的部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_e4e9077d:

    # e "If he's still blessing the tribe, then why did he let the avalanche happen?"
    e "如果他还在庇佑部落，那他为什么会让雪崩发生？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_42d24ee9:

    # "The chief's eyes narrow, his expression darkening as he tries to comprehend your question. It doesn't even seem like he's ever pondered about it."
    "酋长眯起双眼，神情逐渐阴沉，试图理解你的问题。他看起来甚至从未想过这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_177b28a7:

    # kh "Don't you dare question my ancestor, courier. The avalanche happened because of the incompetence of my guards, not because of some superficial blessing."
    kh "你敢质疑我的祖先，信使？那场雪崩是因为我的守卫无能，而不是什么肤浅的庇佑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_24fd526e:

    # "He growls, the white fur on his neck bristling as he glares at you. Even though he just said he doesn't believe in spirits, the mention of his ancestor seems to have struck a nerve."
    "他低声咆哮着，脖颈上的白毛根根竖起，同时怒视着你。尽管他刚才还说自己不相信灵魂，但提到他的祖先似乎还是触动了他的逆鳞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_1d82fd8a:

    # kh "And I don't want to hear any more of this nonsense, courier."
    kh "我不想再听这些胡说八道了，信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_8cf050b2:

    # e "Chief Kaurhu, after what we found in the crypt... do you still think Herd went there to sabotage the tribe?"
    e "卡乌胡酋长，根据我们在地下墓穴里的发现……你还认为赫德去那里是为了破坏部落吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b4abc75f:

    # kh "No."
    kh "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_44fd3233:

    # kh "Not that simply."
    kh "没那么简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_73268d74:

    # e "So the noises in the cave had nothing to do with Herd coming back?"
    e "所以，洞穴里的那些声音和赫德回来没有关系？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b4abc75f_1:

    # kh "No."
    kh "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_fb9e2f01:

    # kh "And I do not intend to let the tribe tell itself that story."
    kh "而且我不会让部落自顾自地相信那套说法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_5b5df098:

    # e "Does that change anything for you?"
    e "这对你有什么改变吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_df7a6e89:

    # kh "Not in any way that helps him."
    kh "至少对他没有任何帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b7bb5eff:

    # e "Chief Kaurhu, do you still think Herd went to that cave just to hide?"
    e "卡乌胡酋长，你还认为赫德去那个洞穴只是为了躲藏吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b4abc75f_2:

    # kh "No."
    kh "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_70745e3e:

    # kh "He had a reason to be there."
    kh "他去那里是有原因的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_84e54b9e:

    # e "And the noises?"
    e "那那些声音呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_0858b66a:

    # kh "Enough to rattle the guards. That is all that matters now."
    kh "足以让守卫们心神不宁。现在重要的就只有这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_60c8d94b:

    # e "Chief Kaurhu, can you tell me more about Herd?"
    e "卡乌胡酋长，你能再告诉我一些关于赫德的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_05a1c963:

    # kh "That sack of shit? What's the matter?"
    kh "那坨狗屎？怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_15add963:

    # e "I wanted to know more about what happened before he... got caught in this matter."
    e "我想多了解一下，在他……被卷入这件事之前发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_dd997de8:

    # e "I wanted to know more about why you guys wanted to catch him."
    e "我想多了解一下，你们为什么想抓住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_b5af68f5:

    # kh "Well, with everything in mind, he was a good, trusted counsel. Had some great thoughts about the frameworks about expanding the tribe into the icy chasm beneath us."
    kh "嗯，考虑到所有事情，他曾是个优秀而且值得信赖的顾问。他对如何把部落扩展到我们脚下的冰冷深渊里，提出过一些很棒的规划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_d54d42cc:

    # kh "I heralded the idea, of course. but Herd was a hustler. His parents were great builders, traditional ones, but he had something different in his mind."
    kh "我当然赞成那个想法。不过赫德是个不安分的家伙。他的父母都是出色的建筑师，走的是传统路子，但他脑子里却有不同的想法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_3f30880d:

    # kh "You can say he's dedicated, while he's working, they said someone could sneak up and stab him and he won't notice a thing."
    kh "可以说他工作时非常专注。有人说，就算偷偷走到他身后捅他一刀，他也什么都察觉不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_27572c8e:

    # e "You speak very fondly of Herd, I thought you hated him, judging by how you called him, sack of shit."
    e "你说起赫德时可真是满怀赞赏啊。听你叫他“那坨狗屎”，我还以为你恨他呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_6ea63181:

    # kh "What can I say, I'm just a charitable person. As much as a sack of shit he became, credits are where credits due."
    kh "我能说什么？我只是个仁慈的人。尽管他后来变成了一坨狗屎，但该算给他的功劳，还是得算给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_9f0616a3:

    # kh "After his parents retired, he was the one who helped build most of the newer shacks. They were warmer, safer, and helped my tribe make it through the long winter."
    kh "他的父母退休后，大部分新棚屋都是他帮忙建的。那些棚屋更暖和、更安全，也帮助我的部落熬过了漫长的冬天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_8c98f9e0:

    # kh "Then, he designed the great furnace, something that burns well for the whole tribe and makes smelting metals, grinding grains, woodworking a little easier."
    kh "后来，他设计了那座大型熔炉。它燃烧得很旺，能供整个部落使用，还让冶炼金属、碾磨谷物和木工活都轻松了一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_5606221a:

    # kh "My people were in the process of building a pipe system underneath the ground, Herd had his whole life dedicated into it."
    kh "我的族人当时正在地下铺设管道系统，而赫德把自己的一生都投入到了这项工程里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_8626b8e3:

    # kh "I approved him and his family to move outside just so he can oversee the project more clearly."
    kh "我批准他和家人搬到外面去，这样他就能更清楚地监督工程。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_917dad5f:

    # e "He moved out of the tribe?"
    e "他搬出部落了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_bb7283c9:

    # kh "He proposed to build the network down the icy chasm, it made sense. but the network of pipe have to be built on the other side, somewhere with a lot of space."
    kh "他提议把管道网络修到冰冷的深渊下方，这听起来很合理。但管道网络必须建在另一边，也就是一处空间很大的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_c318b216:

    # e "Do you think his family could have survived if he didn't move out?"
    e "你觉得，如果他不搬出去，他的家人还能活下来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_ee570cc9:

    # kh "How would I know? He was the one who wanted to move out, I didn't force him to do anything. The tribe was destroyed as much as his new house was, our people were buried in snow."
    kh "我怎么会知道？是他自己想搬出去的，我可没逼他做任何事。部落和他的新房子一样都毁了，我们的人全都埋在了雪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_450f27e5:

    # kh "It's lucky that he survived, but he left the team that day. Apparently, that old brown-snout had his ears stuffed or something."
    kh "他能活下来算是走运，但那天他离开了队伍。显然，那只老棕鼻子的耳朵被什么堵住了之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_a3f7a05b:

    # kh "Couldn't hear, couldn't talk, my tribe's healer had him checked everywhere. But they found nothing."
    kh "听不见，也说不了话。我部落的治疗师把他全身都检查了一遍，但什么也没发现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_c9846fc3:

    # e "So, why did you want to catch the architect?"
    e "那么，你为什么想抓住那个建筑师？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_78234418:

    # kh "He broke the pipes when the rest of the building team picked up where he left off, then he tried to get near the furnace, he never gave me a reason why."
    kh "建筑队的其他人接手了他未完成的工作后，他弄坏了管道。接着，他又试图靠近熔炉，却从没告诉我原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_af341aff:

    # kh "It's probably his grief, or he's trying to sabotage the tribe for someone else."
    kh "可能是因为他的悲痛，也可能是他想替别人破坏部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_0dec2deb:

    # kh "How can you even think to let him get away with that, no, not on my watch."
    kh "你怎么能想放任他做出那种事？不行，在我当值期间绝不允许。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_f5f375cf:

    # kh "So I sent the guards after Herd, just trying to throw him in the prison so I can talk him out of it."
    kh "所以我派卫兵去抓赫德，只是想先把他关进牢里，好劝他打消这个念头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_02d7943d:

    # e "I thought he couldn't hear anything?"
    e "我以为他什么都听不见？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_5db5ba85:

    # kh "Figuratively."
    kh "只是打个比方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_162b194c:

    # kh "I would have figured out a way to talk to him, long as he didn't run away the first glance he sees the guards."
    kh "只要他一看到守卫没有立刻逃跑，我本来就能想办法和他谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_613bd5ed:

    # e "Maybe he was scared you were going to put him in prison."
    e "也许他是怕你会把他关进监狱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_f8706417:

    # kh "I don't care, he was not going to get away with breaking my buildings apart. I would have let him out as soon as we figured out what the fuck was going on."
    kh "我不在乎，他拆毁我的建筑，别想就这么逃脱。等我们弄清楚到底他妈是怎么回事，我本来就会放他出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_8be39b49:

    # kh "If only I got to him before my guards killed him, I have to commend them for their great aim, too well-trained."
    kh "要是我能在守卫杀了他之前赶到就好了。不过也得夸夸他们，准头真好，训练得太到位了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_3764eee2:

    # e "It's really hard to straight up kill a person with a harpoon, wasn't it?"
    e "用鱼叉直接杀人，确实很难，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_92667b78:

    # kh "Not as hard as it seems. Outside, he was fine. But with the barbed edges in our harpoon, it won't be long until he bled out."
    kh "没你想的那么难。当时在外头，他还好好的。但我们的鱼叉带着倒刺，用不了多久他就会失血而死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_37c082be:

    # e "I wonder why he tried to sabotage the tribe in the first place."
    e "我想知道，他一开始为什么要破坏部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_0ae4efc6:

    # kh "Well, there is no use asking a dead man, isn't it."
    kh "不过，去问一个死人也没用，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_830f864e:

    # kh "I'll leave it as it was, it was a tragic end to one of my greatest counsels, but the building will continue as usual."
    kh "我就让这事这样过去吧。我的一位得力谋士落得如此下场，确实很悲惨，但建筑工作会照常继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_6ba811b2:

    # kh "Some day, some day I'll catch him, make him repair the damages he caused, maybe invite him back to work for the tribe again, we'll figure out a way to talk with each other."
    kh "总有一天，总有一天我会抓到他，让他修复自己造成的损失。或许还会请他回来，继续为部落工作；我们总能想办法彼此沟通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_f82e8e0f:

    # kh "After he admits being a sack of shit ruining the tribe, of course, but I will make it work nonetheless."
    kh "当然，得先让他承认自己就是个把部落搞得一团糟的混蛋，不过不管怎样，我会让这事成的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_14dabaf4:

    # e "That's all I need to know, thank you for your time, Chief."
    e "我想知道的就这些了，谢谢你抽出时间，酋长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Kaurhu_Normal_Talk_5f00a6fd:

    # kh "Good."
    kh "很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_1eada15f:

    # d "Hello, [e]. Is there something you needed, or did you just want to talk?"
    d "你好，[e]。你有什么事，还是只是想找我聊聊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_e1e222be:

    # e "Daggi, can you tell me more about the chief?"
    e "达吉，你能多告诉我一些关于酋长的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_8b2ab063:

    # d "Chief Kaurhu? Yes. I think he is a great leader."
    d "酋长卡乌胡？当然。我认为他是位出色的领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_22b17c2b:

    # d "He would hate hearing me repeat it, but the elders still tell stories about the time a Jotunn nearly broke into the tribe and he climbed onto the thing himself to bring it down."
    d "他肯定讨厌听我再提起这件事，但长老们至今仍会讲述那次约顿差点闯入部落，而他亲自爬到那东西身上将它制服的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_156aeb8d:

    # d "He is harsher in manner than he is in judgment. Most people only notice the first part."
    d "他的待人处事比做判断更严厉。大多数人只注意到了前者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_aae4fbf4:

    # e "Oh, the guards told me Chief was your father, was it not?"
    e "哦，守卫告诉我，酋长是你父亲，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_716fe4ce:

    # d "...Yes. Chief never liked our family being treated differently, so we did not speak of it much."
    d "……是的。酋长从不喜欢别人区别对待我们家，所以我们很少提起这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_1b1cc24c:

    # e "That explains everything, the guards thought he was about to abdicate and hand you the title."
    e "这就解释得通了，守卫以为他正要退位，把酋长之位交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_858bb9a5:

    # e "Even though we've met only for a while, you've never striked me as an ambitious leader, why do you want to be the chief?"
    e "虽然我们认识还没多久，但你从没给我留下野心勃勃的领袖印象，你为什么想当酋长？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_de7caca5:

    # d "To be honest, [e], I have wanted that for a long time. Since I was a cub, Chief Kaurhu trained me as if I might one day succeed him."
    d "老实说，[e]，我想要这个位置已经很久了。我还是幼崽时，酋长卡乌胡就把我当作有朝一日可能继承他的位置来训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_e0178888:

    # d "Most of my life has been spent trying to become someone worthy of that place."
    d "我大半辈子都在努力成为配得上那个位置的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_115742ce:

    # e "But he never gave you that nod?"
    e "但他从没对你点过头表示认可吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_7b0b28fe:

    # d "No. He keeps waiting for something. A sign, perhaps. Proof that I am ready."
    d "不。他一直在等些什么。也许是某种信号，证明我已经准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_f807fa55:

    # d "I am still not certain what he expects to see."
    d "我到现在也不确定，他究竟想看到什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_42f4a46a:

    # e "I see..."
    e "我明白了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_267cc724:

    # e "Now that you mentioned it, Chief Kaurhu did seem to have his brows furrowed all the time."
    e "你这么一说，我想起来了，考尔胡酋长似乎总是紧锁眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_ad2d2fca:

    # d "Yes, he often does. I think he carries the whole tribe on his face whether he means to or not."
    d "是啊，他经常这样。我觉得，不管他是不是有意的，整个部族的重担都写在了他脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_6712b1bb:

    # d "Still, I trust him."
    d "不过，我信任他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_bdc8010b:

    # e "Daggi, after the cave... what do you think Herd was doing there?"
    e "达吉，关于那座洞穴……你觉得赫德当时在那里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_3ef4a8c1:

    # d "Looking for something he lost, I think. Or following some line of thought only he could still see."
    d "我想，他是在寻找自己遗失的东西。又或者，他只是在追寻某种只有他自己还能看见的思绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_0be3f4e5:

    # d "Whatever was making the new noises, it was not Herd somehow returning."
    d "不管制造那些新声响的是什么，反正不可能是赫德以某种方式回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_55ba6af3:

    # d "I do not want the tribe telling itself that story."
    d "我不想让部族自己编出那样的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_024a2b43:

    # d "But he had been there before he died, and he had a reason I failed to see in time."
    d "但他死前确实去过那里，而且他有一个我没能及时看出来的理由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_73fac487:

    # e "Daggi, do you think the cave answered what Herd was doing?"
    e "达吉，你觉得那座洞穴回答了赫德当时在做什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_f2155d3b:

    # d "Part of it, yes."
    d "部分回答了，是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_a9a17246:

    # d "He had been there, and none of it was random."
    d "他确实去过那里，而这一切都不是随机发生的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_316a8b8d:

    # d "I think the guards heard Herd moving through the upper cave at first, and deeper in, something older answered back."
    d "我想，守卫们起初听见赫德在上层洞穴里移动，而在更深处，某种更加古老的东西回应了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_8f3e69dc:

    # d "By the time we reached the crypt properly, he was already gone. But at least now I know he was chasing something personal, not just breaking things to spite us."
    d "等我们真正抵达墓穴时，他已经不见了。不过至少现在我知道，他是在追寻某件私人的事情，而不只是为了报复我们才到处搞破坏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_e8e7739d:

    # e "Daggi, can you tell me more about the avalanche?"
    e "达吉，你能再告诉我一些关于那场雪崩的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_3746d867:

    # d "If you must."
    d "既然你非要问。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_a4190eba:

    # e "Daggi, I was wondering, how did you become the commander of the bear tribe?"
    e "达吉，我想问问，你是怎么成为熊族指挥官的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_c7f8b643:

    # d "How did I become commander? It was not anything grand."
    d "我怎么成为指挥官的？没什么了不起的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_9afef78f:

    # e "I'm sure it is, you're kinda leading the tribe, after all."
    e "我相信确实如此，毕竟你也算是在领导部族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_b4b6e938:

    # d "I was just a guard, same as the others. But when Bedwyr, the old commander, was taken to prison, Chief Kaurhu needed someone to hold the tribe together, and he chose me."
    d "但老指挥官贝德维尔被关进监狱后，考尔胡酋长需要有人维系部族，而他选中了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_ef5f3a65:

    # e "Why you?"
    e "为什么是你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_434c506d:

    # d "I was the one who said yes."
    d "因为我是那个答应下来的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_c0f8ee2d:

    # d "That is the plain answer. The less plain answer is that he trusted me to carry it, and I am still trying not to disappoint him."
    d "那是最直接的答案。没那么直接的答案是，他信任我，让我承担这份责任，而我至今仍在努力不让他失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_1bfba8c0:

    # e "That's a lot of responsibility, Daggi. I hope you're doing great."
    e "这责任可不轻啊，达吉。我希望你一切都好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_a0aa8f39:

    # d "I am trying my best, [e]. Some days that feels sufficient. Some days it does not."
    d "我已经尽了最大努力，[e]。有些日子，这感觉还算够了；有些日子，却不够。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_896a8d48:

    # d "I was only a guard before the avalanche. Then there were... complications, and the commander at the time, Bedwyr, was sent to prison."
    d "雪崩发生前，我只是个守卫。后来出了些……变故，当时的指挥官贝德维尔被送进了监狱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_d8fcc4f6:

    # d "There were evidence connecting him to the Avalanche, but I don't want to talk about it."
    d "有证据表明他与那场雪崩有关，但我不想谈这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_42f4a46a_1:

    # e "I see..."
    e "我明白了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_fc32f159:

    # e "What about the guards, are they always like that?"
    e "那些守卫呢？他们一直都是那样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_61298961:

    # d "The guards... I do what I can to keep them in line, but some of them use my inexperience as permission to make their own decisions first."
    d "那些守卫……我能做的都做了，尽量管住他们，可有些人把我的经验不足当成了可以先斩后奏的理由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_9fab7479:

    # e "I thought you were the commander."
    e "我以为你才是指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_5d26cac0:

    # d "I am the commander. That does not mean every guard is wise enough to remember it when they are angry."
    d "我就是指挥官。但这不代表每个守卫在动怒时，都明智到还记得这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_99f01130:

    # d "They listen to Chief Kaurhu without question. They listen to me when it suits them, or when I can make myself impossible to ignore."
    d "他们对考鲁胡酋长言听计从。至于我，他们心情好时才听，或者只有当我强硬到让他们无法忽视时才听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_b3ffcbba:

    # "The bear leans back, then looks away. His eyes are distant, as if he's trying to avoid the topic."
    "熊向后靠了靠，随后移开视线。他的目光飘向远方，仿佛在试图避开这个话题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_59e020b4:

    # e "That's all I need to know, thanks Daggi."
    e "这些就够我知道了，谢谢你，达吉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Daggi_Dialogue_ac60fa45:

    # d "Of course."
    d "当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_691a76dd:

    # "You push open the wooden door, it opens with a small tinkling sound."
    "你推开木门，门发出一声轻微的叮铃声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_5b499fe5:

    # "The warmth in the air inside startles you for a second, as you have been mostly accustomed to the tribe's chilling weather."
    "里面的空气暖意让你一时受惊，毕竟你已经基本习惯了部落那令人发冷的天气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_eeef08e2:

    # "Peeking over the small shop, it looks very clean, fills with shelves and display cases with golden linings, holding a variety of expensive items."
    "你探头打量这家小店，只见店里十分整洁，摆满了货架和陈列柜，柜边镶着金色饰条，里面放着各式各样的昂贵物品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_417a3515:

    # "All of a sudden, the door behind you closes shut, as if a strong wind just slammed the door in your face."
    "突然，你身后的门关得严严实实，仿佛一阵强风迎面将门狠狠砸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_89fe036b:

    # m "Well met, young one, to my humble abode. My name is Methis. How can I call you?"
    m "幸会，年轻人，欢迎来到我的寒舍。我叫梅西斯。该如何称呼你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_a2309121:

    # e "Hey, I'm [e]."
    e "嗨，我是[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_013d4a31:

    # "A one-horned figure pops up from behind the counter, it was a middle-aged rhino who has skin of turquoise and scales of a dark-blue colour."
    "一个独角身影从柜台后冒了出来——那是一头中年犀牛，皮肤呈绿松石色，鳞片则是深蓝色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_37ad3c92:

    # m "Ah, exotic name for an exotic fellow."
    m "啊，奇异的名字，配上奇异的家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_c6f11c3b:

    # m "What is it that you seek today? Weapons, trinkets, scrolls of enchantment? All you see are mine to give, for a price."
    m "今天想找些什么？武器、小玩意，还是附魔卷轴？你看到的这些东西，只要付得起价钱，我都能卖给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_274de6b2:

    # "You are startled by his over-enthusiastic greetings, not to mention the throaty and rasp voice that shakes the entire store."
    "你被他过分热情的招呼吓了一跳，更不用说那震得整间店都在颤动的沙哑低沉嗓音了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_f0e11122:

    # m "Ah, sorry for the fright, little adventurer."
    m "啊，抱歉吓到你了，小冒险家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_2bd39306:

    # m "I just haven't had many visitors lately, so you're a sight for sore eyes. Now, what is it that you seek?"
    m "我最近确实没怎么接待过访客，所以见到你真是让我眼前一亮。那么，你想找些什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_dcda5012:

    # e "I-I'm just looking, sir. But what is all this about?"
    e "我、我只是随便看看，先生。不过，这到底是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_15d3dd21:

    # "You gesture to the windows, wondering why a shopkeeper is keeping a collection of mannequins as decoration."
    "你指了指橱窗，疑惑一个店主为什么要把一群假人摆出来当装饰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_ba7d865f:

    # m "Oh, these?"
    m "哦，这些？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_d61315e5:

    # "He says as he gestures towards the wooden statures."
    "他一边说着，一边朝那些木雕像比了比。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_7a4c4117:

    # m "Well, they are my assistants, they tend to my shop when I go to bed. These two are always eager to please, aren't you, boys?"
    m "嗯，它们是我的助手。我睡觉时，它们会替我照看店铺。这两个家伙总是乐意效劳，对吧，小伙子们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_16284074:

    # "You look at the owner, expecting some kind of reaction or a joke, but he remains staring at the two."
    "你看向店主，期待他会有什么反应或开个玩笑，可他只是继续盯着那两具假人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_97bbfad6:

    # m "This armored stud, is called Kivy; and the right one, he's Aerik, he enjoys basking in some sunlight once in a while, it's not like we're well illuminated down this abyss."
    m "这个穿着铠甲的壮汉叫基维；右边那个叫艾里克。他偶尔喜欢晒晒太阳，毕竟在这深渊底下，光线实在算不上充足。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_416689f3:

    # m "And... they seem to be very interested in you, young one."
    m "而且……它们好像对你很感兴趣，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_c561bfbc:

    # "You look back at the two mannequins, they don't seem to even move an inch. You can hardly believe these materials allow any movement at all, let alone talking."
    "你回头看向那两具假人，它们似乎连一寸都没动过。你实在难以相信这些材料能让它们活动，更别说开口说话了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_ef1f4113:

    # e "I don't think these mannequins are real."
    e "我觉得这些假人不是真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_4025e6c5:

    # m "What are you talking about? My assistants are just doing their job right now, which is showing off the shop's items, you wouldn't want a moving display that runs around the shop, wouldn't you?"
    m "你在说什么？我的助手现在只是在做自己的工作，也就是展示店里的商品。你总不会想要一个在店里到处乱跑的活动展示架吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_b1e0b155:

    # m "They're just a little shy, is all. They'd take care of the shop while I rest at night, and, they're cheaper than a bear cause I don't even need to pay them."
    m "它们只是有点害羞，仅此而已。晚上我休息时，它们会照看店铺，而且它们可比熊便宜多了，毕竟我连工钱都不用付。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_2653c606:

    # e "If you say so..."
    e "既然你这么说……"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_2e924ac8:

    # "You shrug and walk further into the shop. But Methis doesn't stop following you."
    "你耸了耸肩，继续往店里走去。但梅希斯还是紧跟着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_2cb596e8:

    # m "So, what do you seek? Weapons? Trinkets? Scrolls?"
    m "那么，你想找些什么？武器？小饰品？卷轴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_809d0786:

    # e "I- I uh... I will take a look myself. Thank you, Methis."
    e "我、我呃……我自己看看就好。谢谢你，梅希斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_20294b1b:

    # m "Very well."
    m "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_fdfc4e8b:

    # "Methis gives an unnaturally wide smile, one that makes you question if you somehow got under his skin."
    "梅希斯露出一个不自然的灿烂笑容，让你不禁怀疑自己是不是不知怎么惹恼了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_e29705f4:

    # "You can feel the shopkeeper's stare burning the back of your neck as you try to inspect the merchandise."
    "你试着查看商品时，能感觉到店主的目光灼烧着你的后颈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Introduction_1523ae58:

    # m "Give me a shout, if you need anything."
    m "有什么需要就叫我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Dialogue_d64ef163:

    # m "I am here, at your service."
    m "我就在这里，随时为你效劳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_aad9071a:

    # m "What can I do for you today, [e]?"
    m "今天有什么我能为你做的吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_b86c48a7:

    # e "So, Methis. How did you come to own this shop?"
    e "话说，梅希斯，你是怎么拥有这家店的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_8fe9dcad:

    # m "You see, the Finnkel's Gaze was merely a smaller, humble forge a few decades back then."
    m "你看，几十年前，芬克尔之眼还只是一间小而简陋的锻造铺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_83701ff9:

    # m "My friend, Eirik, was an excellent blacksmith, he made all the tailored armors and weapon to each guards of the tribe at the time."
    m "我的朋友艾里克是个出色的铁匠，当时部落里的每名卫兵，都由他打造量身定制的铠甲和武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_a830c153:

    # e "That name sounds familiar..."
    e "这个名字听起来有点耳熟……"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_32fd0253:

    # m "And I, I was a simple merchant, but I know a good business when I see one, and I know how to rope in some customers with my presentation."
    m "而我，我只是个普通商人，但一看到好生意就能认出来，也知道该如何靠自己的推销手段吸引顾客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_c12dc8ab:

    # m "So, after a period of consideration, we decided to merge our shops together, and the Finnkel's Gaze was born."
    m "所以，经过一番考虑，我们决定把两家店合并起来，于是芬克尔之凝视就诞生了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_0031acee:

    # e "So, why did you name it Finnkel's Gaze?"
    e "那么，你为什么把它命名为芬克尔之凝视？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_b9475d4b:

    # m "Because, this is where we are, the Finnkel Abyss, it stretches far outside of the tribe, and I liked the sound of '{i}Gaze{/i}'. It's catchy, don't you think?"
    m "因为我们所在的地方就是芬克尔深渊，它延伸到了部落之外很远的地方，而我很喜欢“{i}凝视{/i}”这个词的感觉。很抓耳，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_d26f808a:

    # e "Ah, I see."
    e "啊，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_51617c49:

    # m "Look, I handle the marketing side of the business, and Eirik handles the crafting side of the business."
    m "你看，生意上的宣传由我负责，制作方面则交给艾里克。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_0921ffc3:

    # m "And, together, we are the best shop in the tribe, we have the best armors, the best weapons, and everything in between."
    m "我们一起经营着部落里最好的店，拥有最好的铠甲、最好的武器，以及介于两者之间的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_36c30350:

    # m "The other shops in the tribe, they couldn't even compare to us, we basically ate them all, consumed nicely in the belly of the beast."
    m "部落里的其他店根本没法和我们相比，基本都被我们吃光了，全都好好地吞进了这头野兽的肚子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_df3d627d:

    # "The rhino slaps his belly, giving you a hearty smile."
    "这头犀牛拍了拍自己的肚子，朝你露出热情洋溢的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_7526b972:

    # m "Not literally, of course."
    m "当然，不是真的吃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_e6621df7:

    # e "It sounds like you two were a great team."
    e "听起来，你们两个真是天作之合。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_f24c1279:

    # m "He has the craftmanship, and I have the showmanship. We are a match made in heaven, I tell you, and we... we were unstoppable."
    m "他有手艺，我有展示和宣传的本事。我跟你说，我们简直是天作之合，而且我们……我们所向披靡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_3b188833:

    # e "So, what happened to Eirik? Is he still around?"
    e "那么，艾里克后来怎么样了？他还在这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_79707e7a:

    # "The shopkeeper suddenly takes a long pause, his mouth hangs agape before resuming back to his usual self."
    "店主突然沉默了很久，张着嘴愣了一会儿，才恢复平时的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_c35d96fb:

    # m "D-don't worry, he is still around, he's just busy at this time. I'm sure... he will grow to like you when he's back."
    m "别、别担心，他还在，只是现在正忙着。我相信……等他回来后，他会慢慢喜欢上你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_4b041ff2:

    # "The rhino chuckles, staring out the windows."
    "犀牛轻声笑着，望向窗外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_17bcd6d6:

    # m "{size=20}He'll be back, any moment now.{/size}"
    m "{size=20}他随时都可能回来。{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_fc1fbacb:

    # "You can't help but feel a little bit of unease, as if there's something wrong, but you decide to brush it off."
    "你不禁感到一丝不安，仿佛有什么地方不对劲，但你决定不去在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_fb72dab5:

    # e "So, what's your reputation in the bear tribe?"
    e "那么，你在熊族里的名声如何？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_2e0fa1b2:

    # m "Maybe you should ask the bears yourself, I'm just a humble shopkeeper."
    m "也许你该亲自去问问那些熊，我只是个卑微的店主而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_0e986c3f:

    # m "For what I know, the chief's got a bigger fish to fry, so he doesn't bother me much."
    m "据我所知，酋长有更要紧的事要忙，所以不怎么来管我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_01f9822a:

    # m "But the guards, they love my shop, they come here to buy armors, weapons, and all other stuff, they're my best customers."
    m "不过那些卫兵很喜欢我的店，他们会来这里购买铠甲、武器和其他各种东西。他们可是我最好的顾客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_2250a1c2:

    # e "Ah, I see. What about the other shops? Do you have any competition?"
    e "啊，我明白了。那其他店铺呢？你有竞争对手吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_9655d276:

    # m "The other shops? They're just a bunch of amateurs, if you need anything at all, you come to Finnkel's Gaze."
    m "其他店铺？不过是一群业余货色罢了。你要是缺什么，尽管来芬克尔之凝视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_e4a7d442:

    # e "How about... like from the other tribes?"
    e "其他部族的呢……比如说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_3fd118cd:

    # m "Uh... oh... the others. We don't wander out much, but I heard there's a lone potion maker back in the warm land, I've heard a lot about him."
    m "呃……哦，你是说其他部族。我们不太常外出，不过我听说温暖之地那边有个独自经营的药剂师，关于他的事我听说了不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_6107fb6d:

    # m "But, I'm not worried about anyone out of our land, I have my own customers, and they're loyal to me."
    m "不过，我不担心我们地界之外的人。我有自己的客人，他们都很忠于我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_949cbca2:

    # e "So, what's new about you?"
    e "那么，你最近有什么新鲜事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_7edd8cf1:

    # m "Ah well, the shop's getting some new collections after uncovering some of the artifacts from the avalanche."
    m "这个嘛，店里要添一些新藏品了，毕竟我们从雪崩中发掘出了一些遗物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_a70749ed:

    # m "It will be very exciting, I promise."
    m "一定会很有意思的，我保证。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_19fae5c5_1:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_eef9709a:

    # e "Okay, thanks for your time, Methis."
    e "好吧，谢谢你抽时间，梅西斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Methis_Normal_Talk_9d9df22c:

    # m "No problem."
    m "没事。"
